(i) (ii) (iii) (iv)

![Four prism diagrams (i)(ii)(iii)(iv) showing different light ray paths through prisms with media n1, n2, n3](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/26dce2f5-44c1-4227-b9a1-4336b77f4364.png)', 'A: (i) is correct if $n_2 > n_1$ and $n_2 > n_3$
B: (ii) is correct if $n_1 = n_2$ and $n_2 > n_3$
C: (iii) is correct if $n_2 < n_1$ and $n_2 = n_3$
D: (iv) is correct if $n_1 > n_2$ and $n_2 < n_3$', 'Answer key lists both (c) and (d) as wrong statements.
For case (iii): if $n_2 < n_1$ the ray bends away from normal entering the prism, but $n_2 = n_3$ means no bending at exit — so the depicted path in (iii) would be wrong.
For case (iv): $n_1 > n_2$ and $n_2 < n_3$ together lead to the ray bending in a way inconsistent with the path shown in (iv).
Hence options (c) and (d) are both wrong statements.', NULL, 'Requires human/source review; not approved for automatic correction', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T08:47:53.969Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/961?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
