B: 157.5 m/s
C: 210 m/s
D: 315 m/s', 'Difference between consecutive harmonics = $\frac{v}{2l}$: $420-315=105 = \frac{v}{2\times0.75}$.
$v = 105\times1.5 = 157.5\ \text{m/s}$.
Wait — answer key says (d). Let me recheck: $v=2l\times105=2\times0.75\times105=157.5$ m/s.
Hence option (d) 315 m/s — checking: $n=3$ gives $f_1=315$ Hz, $f_2=420$ Hz with $v=315$ m/s: $v/2l=315/1.5=210$, $n=1.5$? Not integer. So $v=157.5$ m/s; answer key says (d) which maps to 315 m/s here — possible option labelling mismatch.', NULL, 'Requires human/source review; not approved for automatic correction', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T08:47:53.969Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/3162?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (3175, 'A: 4 kV', '8 kV (option C)', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'NEET', '2. Electrostatic Potential and Capacitance', '1-5000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Limiting charge and voltage sum give 8 kV; saved key is 4 kV.', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 1473, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'A capacitor of capacitance $C_1 = 1\ \mu$F can withstand maximum voltage $V_1 = 6$ kV and another capacitor of capacitance $C_2 = 3\ \mu$F can withstand maximum voltage $V_2 = 4$ kV. When they are connected in series, the combined system can withstand a maximum voltage of', 'A: 4 kV
B: 6 kV
C: 8 kV
D: 10 kV', 'In series, charge $Q$ is same on both. Max charge on $C_1$: $Q_1=C_1V_1=6\ \mu$C; on $C_2$: $Q_2=C_2V_2=12\ \mu$C. Limiting charge = 6 $\mu$C.
Total voltage $= Q/C_1+Q/C_2 = 6+2=8$ kV — but check: answer key says (a). With $Q=6\ \mu$C: $V_1=6$ kV, $V_2=6/3=2$ kV, total = 8 kV. Answer key says (a)=4kV is inconsistent; likely 8 kV is correct.', NULL, 'Requires human/source review; not approved for automatic correction', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T08:47:53.969Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/3175?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (3177, 'D: $3.8\times10^{-11}$ Wb', 'B·area ≈3.77×10⁻¹¹ Wb', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'NEET', '4. Moving Charges and Magnetism', '1-5000', 'Unsupported adjustment / explanation defect; key not proven wrong', NULL, 'Stored calculation writes 10⁻¹⁰, while its own numerical inputs give 10⁻¹¹, agreeing with key. Orientation wording also merits review.', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 1474, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'A circular loop of radius 0.3 cm lies parallel to a long straight wire carrying current 2 A. The centre of the loop is 0.1 m from the wire. The magnetic flux through the loop is', 'A: $9.4\times10^{-11}$ Wb
B: $4.7\times10^{-11}$ Wb
C: $6.0\times10^{-11}$ Wb
D: $3.8\times10^{-11}$ Wb', '$B = \frac{\mu_0 I}{2\pi d} = \frac{4\pi\times10^{-7}\times2}{2\pi\times0.1} = 4\times10^{-6}$ T.
$\Phi = B\cdot\pi r^2 = 4\times10^{-6}\times\pi\times(3\times10^{-3})^2 \approx 3.77\times10^{-10}$ Wb — answer key gives (d); likely $r=0.3$ cm = $3\times10^{-3}$ m.
Hence option (d) is correct.', NULL, 'Requires human/source review; not approved for automatic correction', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T08:47:53.969Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/3177?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (3179, 'B: 12 $\Omega$', '0 Ω for stated battery and gradient', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'NEET', '3. Current Electricity', '1-5000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Solution calculates zero required series resistance, then tries changing the battery to fit saved 12 Ω; no matching option.', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 1475, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'A potentiometer wire has length 4 m and resistance 8 $\Omega$. The resistance that must be connected in series with the wire and a 4 V battery of negligible resistance so that potential drop along the wire is 1 V per metre is', 'A: 16 $\Omega$
B: 12 $\Omega$
C: 4 $\Omega$
D: 8 $\Omega$', 'Required voltage across 4 m wire = $1\times4 = 4$ V — but battery is 4 V total, so voltage drop across wire must be 4 V and series resistance drops 0 V? That means $V_{wire}=4$ V with $R_{wire}=8\Omega$.
Actually required drop per metre = 1 V/m over 4 m = 4 V total across wire; battery = 4 V, no room for series resistance — so likely battery is higher, or options suggest $R_{series}=12\ \Omega$: $I=4/(8+R)$; $V_{wire}=8I=1\times4=4$ V; $I=0.5$ A; $R=4/0.5-8=8-8=0$? Recheck with battery being larger — answer key (b)=12$\ \Omega$: $I=4/(8+12)=0.2$ A; $V_{wire}=0.2\times8=1.6$ V, drop per metre=0.4 V. Not 1 V/m. Possible battery is higher voltage not 4V.', NULL, 'Requires human/source review; not approved for automatic correction', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T08:47:53.969Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/3179?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (3221, 'D: $\sqrt{10}\,\text{rad/s}$', '10 rad/s (option B)', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'NEET', '4. Laws of Motion', '1-5000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Both derivation and final option declaration say B, but the stored key is √10 rad/s (D).', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 1476, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'A block of mass 10 kg is in contact against the inner wall of a hollow cylindrical drum of radius 1 m. The coefficient of friction between the block and the inner wall of the cylinder is 0.1. The minimum angular velocity needed for the cylinder to keep the block stationary when the cylinder is vertical and rotating about its axis, will be $(g = 10\,\text{m/s}^2)$', 'A: $\dfrac{10}{2\pi}\,\text{rad/s}$
B: $10\,\text{rad/s}$
C: $10\pi\,\text{rad/s}$
D: $\sqrt{10}\,\text{rad/s}$', 'Normal force $N = mr\omega^2$; friction $f = \mu N \geq mg$ gives $\mu mr\omega^2 \geq mg$.
$\omega_{\min} = \sqrt{\dfrac{g}{\mu r}} = \sqrt{\dfrac{10}{0.1 \times 1}} = \sqrt{100} = 10\,\text{rad/s}$.
Wait — re-checking: $\sqrt{10/0.1} = \sqrt{100} = 10$, so option (b) $10\,\text{rad/s}$ is correct.', NULL, 'Requires human/source review; not approved for automatic correction', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T08:47:53.969Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/3221?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (3241, 'A: Kingdom, Phylum, Class, Order, Family, Genus, Species', 'Species → … → Kingdom', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Biology', 'NEET', '1. The Living World', '1-5000', 'No-valid-option assertion with a saved option', NULL, 'Explanation rejects all descending-order options for an ascending-order question, yet the descending sequence is saved.', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 1477, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'In the taxonomic categories which hierarchical arrangement in ascending order is correct in case of animals?', 'A: Kingdom, Phylum, Class, Order, Family, Genus, Species
B: Kingdom, Class, Phylum, Family, Order, Genus, Species
C: Kingdom, Order, Class, Phylum, Family, Genus, Species
D: Kingdom, Order, Phylum, Class, Family, Genus, Species', 'The answer key marks this as (*) — None of these — because the listed options show descending order (Kingdom to Species) but the question asks for ascending order (Species to Kingdom), and no option correctly presents ascending order.
The correct ascending sequence is: Species → Genus → Family → Order → Class → Phylum → Kingdom.
Hence none of the given options is correct; the answer key marks (*) accordingly.', NULL, 'Requires human/source review; not approved for automatic correction', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T08:47:53.969Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/3241?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
