conclusion_key', '{"category": "Inconsistency", "id": 7097, "quote": "The explanation explicitly concludes a different option from the selected key.", "reason": "Explanation indicates a different product structure from the one stored in the answer key."}', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 1502, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'The major product of the following reaction is

$$\underset{\text{(cyclopentane ring with CN substituent and ketone)}}{} \xrightarrow{\text{(i) }\ce{CH3MgBr (excess)}, \text{ (ii) }\ce{H3O+}}$$

![2025img78](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/0a116d79-c2ad-4031-b06f-8830e7237e16.webp)', 'A: $\ce{H3C}$ and $\ce{OH}$ on ring, $\ce{-CH3}$ and $\ce{CH3}$ groups (diol product)

