B: Cyclopentyl ring with ketone and $\ce{-CH3}$ side chain

![Option (b): cyclopentyl ketone with CH3 chain](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/61b6de4e-604c-48f3-a843-e5495c325280.webp)
C: Cyclopentyl ring with $\ce{OH}$ and $\ce{CN}$ groups and $\ce{CH3}$

