B: introduction of high yielding varieties
C: extensive use of fertilisers
D: extensive use of insecticides and pesticides', 'Introduction of high-yielding varieties (HYVs) leads to replacement of many traditional/local varieties (landraces), drastically reducing genetic diversity — this is called genetic erosion or genetic uniformity.
Hence option (2) — introduction of high yielding varieties — wait, the key says answer 4, which is option (4) extensive use of insecticides and pesticides. However, standard biology knowledge strongly supports option (2). The official key answer is 4.', NULL, '{"category": "Inconsistency", "id": 8468, "quote": "the key says answer 4... standard biology knowledge strongly supports option (2).", "reason": "Explanation indicates that the official answer key contradicts scientific facts."}', 'Yes', 'Historical timestamp not recorded'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/8468?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_ur