B: $1 + \dfrac{1}{x^2}$
C: $x^2 - \dfrac{1}{x^2}$
D: $3x^2 - 3$', '$fog(x)=f\left(x-\frac{1}{x}\right)=\left(x-\frac{1}{x}\right)^3+3\left(x-\frac{1}{x}\right)=x^3-\frac{1}{x^3}$.
So $f(t)=t^3+3t$, giving $f''(t)=3t^2+3$.
