![Circuit diagram with battery, three resistors R, two inductors L, and a capacitor C with a switch](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/6ceec9d8-c511-4129-a594-c631bcdab3fa.png)', 'A: 2 mA
B: 0.2 A
