D: (iv) (iii) (ii) (i)', '1.52 g He (atomic mass 4): moles = 1.52/4 = 0.38 mol; volume at STP = 0.38 × 22.4 ≈ 8.5 L → does not match directly; recheck—1.52 g gives 0.38 mol, not matching (iii) directly.
