B: (2), (1), (3)
C: (1), (3), (2)
D: (3), (2), (1)', 'Ti (Z=22): transition metal, [Ar] 3d² 4s².
Ca (Z=20): alkaline earth, [Ar] 4s².
Sc (Z=21): transition metal, [Ar] 3d¹ 4s².
Atomic radius increases down the periodic table and decreases across a period (left to right).
Ca < Sc < Ti (Ca is above, Sc and Ti are d-block with similar sizes).
But actually: Ca (period 4) < Sc (period 4, d-block) < Ti (same period, further right in d-block).
No: covalent radius generally follows: Ca > Sc ≈ Ti (d-block radii are closer).
Actual trend: Ca > Sc > Ti (metals become slightly smaller with increasing d electrons).
Order of increasing radius: (1) Ti < (3) Sc < (2) Ca = wrong.
Re-examining: typically Ca ≈ Sc ≈ Ti in size; Ca is slightly larger. Order: Ti < Sc < Ca = (1), (3), (2).
But the answer given is (b) = (2), (1), (3) = Ca, Ti, Sc.
This suggests Ca < Ti < Sc, which contradicts typical trends. Trusting source.
Hence option (b) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/12691?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
