List-I: 1. Bauxite, 2. White bauxite, 3. Red bauxite, 4. Refining of aluminium

List-II: (i) $\ce{NaOH}$, (ii) $\ce{Al2O3.3H2O}$, (iii) Serpeck''s process, (iv) $\ce{Al2O3.2H2O}$, (v) Hoope''s process

The correct matching is:', 'A: (i) (iv) (v) (iii)
B: (v) (iii) (ii) (iv)
C: (iv) (iii) (i) (v)
D: (iv) (v) (i) (iii)', 'Bauxite: purified via Bayer''s process using $\ce{NaOH}$ → (i) (better fit: ore itself, but not listed; closest is origin process).
White bauxite: $\ce{Al2O3.3H2O}$ gibbsite form → (iv).
Red bauxite: $\ce{Al2O3.H2O}$ or $\ce{Al2O3.2H2O}$ hematite-stained → (v) label mismatch; use (i) or (ii).
Refining: Hoope''s process → (v).
Best match accounting for the structure: 1→(iv), 2→(v), 3→(i), 4→(iii) doesn''t align perfectly. 
Re-examine: 1→(iv), 2→(iv) is wrong. Likely 1→(v), 2→(iv), 3→(i), 4→(iii) or similar.
Given options, (d) (iv)(v)(i)(iii) suggests 1→(iv), 2→(v), 3→(i), 4→(iii).
Hence option (d) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/13471?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
