B: 1, 2, 3
C: (b) 1, 3, 4
D: (c) 2, 3, 4', 'Tl is actually less electropositive than Al due to poor screening (statement 1 false).
Al is more electropositive than Tl (statement 2 ✓).
Tl⁺³ is unstable and acts as an oxidising agent; it readily reduces to Tl⁺ (statement 3 false).
