B: 1, 2, 4
C: (b) 1, 2, 3
D: (c) 2, 3, 4', 'Boric acid acts as a Lewis acid, not a Brønsted (protonic) acid (statement 1 false).
Be exhibits coordination number 4 (tetrahedral), not 6 (statement 2 false).
$\ce{BeCl2}$ and $\ce{AlCl3}$ form bridged dimeric structures in solid state (statement 3 ✓).
$\ce{B3N3H6}$ (borazine) is called inorganic benzene; $\ce{B2H6.2NH3}$ is not (statement 4 false).
Statements 1, 2, and 4 are incorrect.
Hence option (a) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/13591?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (13596, 'C: In borazole the negative charge is carried out by borons.', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Chemistry', 'NEET', '3. Classification of Elements and Periodicity in Properties', '10001-15000', 'Unsupported adjustment / explanation defect; key not proven wrong', NULL, 'The final line calls C ''1,3,4'', although current C is a single statement, not that combination. The solution and current option structure are out of alignment; the saved key itself is not thereby proven wrong.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1770, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Which of the following is incorrect?', 'A: A crystalline form of boron nitride called borazon is harder than diamond.
B: All the B - N bonds are equal in borazine.
C: In borazole the negative charge is carried out by borons.
D: Borazole is less reactive than benzene.', 'Borazon (cubic BN) is one of the hardest materials, harder than diamond (statement 1 correct).
In borazine, all B–N bonds are equivalent due to resonance (statement 2 correct).
In borazole, the negative charge is localized on nitrogen atoms (due to their greater electronegativity), not borons (statement 3 incorrect).
Borazole is less reactive than benzene because the B–N dative bonds reduce aromaticity (statement 4 correct).
Hence option (c) 1,3,4 is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/13596?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (13601, 'D: Boric acid is less soluble in hot water but more soluble in cold water.', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Chemistry', 'NEET', '3. Classification of Elements and Periodicity in Properties', '10001-15000', 'Unsupported adjustment / explanation defect; key not proven wrong', NULL, 'The final line calls D ''2,3,4'', although current D is one solubility statement. Remove or resolve the stale combined-option reference rather than automatically changing D.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1771, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'Which of the following is incorrect?', 'A: Borax glass is the anhydrous form of borax.
B: Jeweller''s borax is obtained by crystallizing the solution at 25°C.
C: Decahydrate form of borax is obtained by crystallizing the solution at 60°C.
D: Boric acid is less soluble in hot water but more soluble in cold water.', 'Borax glass is the anhydrous form $\ce{Na2B4O7}$ obtained by heating borax (statement 1 correct).
Jeweller''s borax is the pentahydrate obtained by crystallizing at 25°C (statement 2 correct).
The decahydrate form is obtained by crystallizing at temperatures below 60°C (statement 3 correct as stated).
Boric acid shows unusual solubility: it is MORE soluble in hot water, not less (statement 4 incorrect).
Hence option (d) 2,3,4 is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/13601?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (13608, 'C: (v) (iv) (ii) (iii)', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Chemistry', 'NEET', '3. Classification of Elements and Periodicity in Properties', '10001-15000', 'Unsupported adjustment / explanation defect; key not proven wrong', NULL, 'The matching explanation says B to -3 is inapplicable/mismatched but still uses that row to select C. Verify the displayed source lists.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1772, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Match the following: List-I: (1) Al (2) B (3) B(OH)₃ (4) Anhydrous AlCl₃ | List-II: (i) Most abundant element in the earth''s crust (ii) Boric acid (iii) Catalyst in Friedel–Crafts reaction (iv) -3 (v) Most abundant metal in the earth''s crust The correct matching is:', 'A: (v) (iii) (ii) (i)
B: (i) (iv) (v) (ii)
C: (v) (iv) (ii) (iii)
D: (iv) (v) (iii) (ii)', 'Al is the most abundant metal in earth''s crust → (v).
B is element number 5 (−3 not applicable; B''s group oxidation is +3) → (iv) seems mismatched.
$\ce{B(OH)3}$ is boric acid → (ii).
Anhydrous $\ce{AlCl3}$ is a Lewis acid used as catalyst in Friedel–Crafts reaction → (iii).
Hence option (c) (v) (iv) (ii) (iii) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/13608?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
