B: (v) (iii) (ii) (iv)
C: (iv) (iii) (i) (v)
D: (iv) (v) (i) (iii)', 'Bauxite is impure $\ce{Al2O3}$ extracted using $\ce{NaOH}$ (Baeyer''s process) → (iv) mismatches; Bauxite ore is processed, not directly a refining method.
White bauxite is $\ce{Al2O3.3H2O}$ → (ii) mismatches in position.
Red bauxite is $\ce{Al2O3.2H2O}$ → (iv) mismatches.
Refining of aluminium is done by Hoope''s process → (v).
Based on the provided answer options, option (d) appears to match: (iv) (v) (i) (iii).', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/13611?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (13618, 'D: Statement-I is incorrect and Statement-II is correct.', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Chemistry', 'NEET', '3. Classification of Elements and Periodicity in Properties', '10001-15000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'The explanation says BCl3 is stronger than BF3, which agrees with Statement I, but labels I false and selects D.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1774, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Statement-I: $\ce{BF3}$ is a weaker Lewis acid than $\ce{BCl3}$ Statement-II: The planar $\ce{BF3}$ molecule is stabilized to a greater extent than $\ce{BCl3}$ by B – X $\pi$-bonding.', 'A: Statement-I and Statement-II both are correct.
B: Statement-I and Statement-II both are incorrect.
C: Statement-I is correct and Statement-II is incorrect.
D: Statement-I is incorrect and Statement-II is correct.', '$\ce{BCl3}$ is a stronger Lewis acid than $\ce{BF3}$ because Cl is larger and less electronegative, making B more electron-deficient; F''s high electronegativity reduces B''s Lewis acidity (Statement-I false).
$\ce{BF3}$ is stabilized by strong B–F $\pi$-bonding (back bonding) more than $\ce{BCl3}$ is stabilized by B–Cl bonding (Statement-II correct).
Hence option (d) Statement-I is incorrect and Statement-II is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/13618?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (13733, 'B: Protocatechualdehyde / 2,3-dihydroxybenzaldehyde', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Chemistry', 'NEET', '8. Organic Chemistry — Some Basic Principles and Techniques', '10001-15000', 'Multiple accepted answers or inconsistent conclusion', NULL, 'The solution explicitly identifies both B and D as wrongly named, but keeps only B because it is a ''clearer'' error.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1775, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Which is incorrectly matched?

 Common name / IUPAC name', 'A: Vanillin / 4-hydroxy-3-methoxybenzaldehyde
B: Protocatechualdehyde / 2,3-dihydroxybenzaldehyde
C: Adipic acid / Hexan1, 6-dioic acid
D: Pyruvic acid / Cis-2-methylbut-2-enoic acid', 'Vanillin is correctly named 4-hydroxy-3-methoxybenzaldehyde (OH at 4, OCH₃ at 3).
Protocatechualdehyde is 3,4-dihydroxybenzaldehyde, NOT 2,3-dihydroxybenzaldehyde.
Adipi acid = hexanedioic acid (6-carbon diacid with COOH at both ends).
Pyruvic acid = 2-oxopropanoic acid, not cis-2-methylbut-2-enoic acid.
Option (b) is incorrectly matched (and option d is also wrong, but b is clearer error).
