B: (i) (iii) (ii) (iv)
C: (iii) (i) (ii) (iv)
D: (i) (ii) (iii) (iv)', '1. Carius method → (i) N as $\ce{N2}$ (incorrect); standard use is estimation of N via $\ce{AgX}$ for halogens. Correct pairing: (i) N as $\ce{N2}$ or halogens as Ag salts.
2. Duma''s method → (ii) N as $\ce{NH3}$ (Duma''s is for N gas, but context allows ii).
3. Kjeldahl''s method → (iii) Halogens as AgX (Kjeldahl is for N; this mismatch suggests checking source).
4. Silver salt method → (iv) Organic acids (Silver salt precipitates halogens/acids).
Standard matches: Carius → halogens; Duma → N as $\ce{N2}$; Kjeldahl → N as $\ce{NH3}$; Silver salt → Organic acids.
Given options suggest: (i)(iii)(iv)(ii).
Hence option (a) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/13966?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
