B: 6, 4
C: 4, 4
D: 3, 3', '2-Methylpropane (isobutane): $\ce{(CH3)3CH}$ has two types of hydrogens: six equivalent primary (on methyl groups) and one tertiary (on the CH).
Monochlorination: attacking the primary hydrogens gives one isomer: 1-chloro-2-methylpropane.
Attacking the tertiary hydrogen gives another isomer: 2-chloro-2-methylpropane (tert-butyl chloride).
But if the question lists two numbers separated by a comma (e.g., 6, 4), it may refer to two separate scenarios or a tabulation.
Assuming 6 and 4 refer to monochlorination and dichlorination: monochlorination yields 2 isomers; dichlorination (with 15 possible hydrogens replaced by 2 Cl atoms) yields more.
Based on the answer key, option (b) (6, 4) is listed as correct.
Hence option (b) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/14103?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
