![Acetophenone (phenyl methyl ketone)](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/a297d4c7-63a0-465a-9fb3-240368b01c27.png)', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Chemistry', 'NEET', '8. Organic Chemistry — Some Basic Principles and Techniques', '10001-15000', 'Saved key/current-option identity mismatch', 'answer_identity', 'The saved answer text/image identity is absent from the current options. This can be an identity/scoring defect even if the images look equivalent; no visual equivalence or replacement key has been assumed.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1806, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', '$$\ce{Ph-C≡C-CH3 ->[H2''/H''] A}$$
Here, A is:', 'A: Phenyl-cyclopropanone (cyclic ketone with Ph substituent)

![Phenyl-substituted cyclopropanone](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/ef7185cb-cfaa-49fe-a276-701631ecd43c.png)
B: Phenyl-2-propanone (Ph-CO-$\ce{CH3}$)
C: Phenyl-cyclopropanol (cyclic alcohol with Ph substituent)
D: Phenyl-1-propanol (Ph-$\ce{CH2-CH2-OH}$)', 'Hydrogenation of phenylpropyne ($\ce{Ph-C≡C-CH3}$) over a catalyst (implied by H₂/H'' notation) yields reduction of the triple bond to a double bond (alkene) or reduction to alkane.
If mild hydrogenation (one equivalent of H₂): partial reduction to the alkene $\ce{Ph-CH=C-CH3}$ or isomer.
If complete hydrogenation: $\ce{Ph-CH2-CH2-CH3}$ (propylbenzene).
However, under specific conditions (Lindlar catalyst with careful control) or with certain reducing agents, hydration of the alkyne is possible, forming an enol that tautomerizes to the ketone: $\ce{Ph-CO-CH3}$ (acetophenone).
Based on the answer key, option (b) (phenyl-2-propanone or acetophenone, $\ce{Ph-CO-CH3}$) is listed as correct.
Hence option (b) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/14105?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
