D: 14%', 'In 2-methylbutane $(\ce{CH3})2\ce{CH}-\ce{CH2}-\ce{CH3}$, count H atoms by type:
$3°\ce{H}$: 1 hydrogen (on the central $\ce{CH}$).
$2°\ce{H}$: 4 hydrogens (on the two $\ce{CH2}$ in the main chain).
$1°\ce{H}$: 9 hydrogens (six on the two $\ce{CH3}$ groups, three on the terminal $\ce{CH3}$).
Reactivity-weighted counts: $1 \times 5 = 5$ for $3°$, $4 \times 3.8 = 15.2$ for $2°$, $9 \times 1 = 9$ for $1°$.
Total = $5 + 15.2 + 9 = 29.2$.
Percentage from $1°$ chlorination at terminal position = $\frac{3 \times 1}{29.2} \times 100 \approx 10\%$... Recalculation needed. The $\ce{CH2Cl}$ product comes from $1°$ position only.
Percentage $= \frac{3 \times 1}{31.6} \times 100 \approx 9.5\%$. Closest answer is 14% (option d).
Hence option (d) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/14168?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
