B: CO forms carboxyhaemoglobin with haemoglobin.
C: Si is the most abundant element in earth crust.
D: None is incorrect.', 'Statement (a): True. $\ce{C-C}$ bond energy (348 kJ/mol) is high, enabling extensive chain formation.
