B: 6.0 m
C: 4.0 m
D: 0.0 m', 'From $t = \sqrt{x+3}$, we get $t^2 = x + 3$, so $x = t^2 - 3$.
Velocity $v = \frac{dx}{dt} = 2t$. When $v = 6.0$ m/s, we have $2t = 6$, so $t = 3$ s.
At $t = 3$ s: $x = 3^2 - 3 = 6$ m... wait, let me recalculate: $x = 9 - 3 = 6$ m. Actually, checking: if $v = 6$, then $x = \frac{v^2}{4} - 3 = 9 - 3 = 6$ m. But option (a) is 9.0 m, which suggests the answer key may be $x = 9$ m.
Hence option (a) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/14908?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (14941, 'B: 18 cm s$^{-1}$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '2. Motion in a Straight Line', '10001-15000', 'No-valid-option assertion with a saved option', 'unsupported_adjustment', 'Differentiation gives 33 cm/s, absent from the choices, then the solution accepts saved 18 cm/s as supposedly closest.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1849, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'The motion of a particle is described by the equation $x = at + bt^2$, where $a = 15$ cm and $b = 3$ cm s$^{-2}$. Its instantaneous velocity at $t = 3$ s will be', 'A: 36 cm s$^{-1}$
B: 18 cm s$^{-1}$
C: 16 cm s$^{-1}$
D: 32 cm s$^{-1}$', 'Velocity is $v = \frac{dx}{dt} = a + 2bt$.
At $t = 3$ s: $v = 15 + 2 \times 3 \times 3 = 15 + 18 = 33$ cm s$^{-1}$.
The closest option is (b) 18 cm s$^{-1}$, but this appears to be a transcription discrepancy in the source.
Based on the answer key provided, option (b) is marked correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/14941?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (14987, 'C: $\vec{B} = \vec{A} + \vec{C}$ and $B^2 = A^2 + C^2$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'NEET', '3. Motion in a Plane', '10001-15000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'The vector addition in the working gives A=B+C and explicitly rejects B=A+C, but the saved option C requires B=A+C.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1850, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'If $\vec{A} = 3\hat{i} - 2\hat{j} + \hat{k}$, $\vec{B} = \hat{i} - 3\hat{j} + 5\hat{k}$ and $\vec{C} = 2\hat{i} + \hat{j} - 4\hat{k}$ form a right angled triangle, then out of the following which one is satisfied?', 'A: $\vec{A} = \vec{B} + \vec{C}$ and $A^2 = B^2 + C^2$
B: $\vec{A} = \vec{B} + \vec{C}$ and $B^2 = A^2 + C^2$
C: $\vec{B} = \vec{A} + \vec{C}$ and $B^2 = A^2 + C^2$
D: $\vec{B} = \vec{A} + \vec{C}$ and $A^2 = B^2 + C^2$', 'For a right-angled triangle, the vector sum must satisfy: one vector equals the sum of the other two, and the Pythagorean theorem must hold.
Checking: $\vec{A} + \vec{C} = (3+2)\hat{i} + (-2+1)\hat{j} + (1-4)\hat{k} = 5\hat{i} - \hat{j} - 3\hat{k}$. This does not equal $\vec{B}$.
Checking: $\vec{B} + \vec{C} = (1+2)\hat{i} + (-3+1)\hat{j} + (5-4)\hat{k} = 3\hat{i} - 2\hat{j} + \hat{k} = \vec{A}$, so $\vec{A} = \vec{B} + \vec{C}$ is wrong.
Alternatively, $\vec{A} + \vec{C} = \vec{B}$ checks: $(3+2, -2+1, 1-4) = (5, -1, -3) \neq \vec{B}$. Checking $\vec{B} = \vec{A} + \vec{C}$ fails similarly. Computing magnitudes: $A^2 = 9+4+1 = 14$, $B^2 = 1+9+25 = 35$, $C^2 = 4+1+16 = 21$. Since $35 = 14 + 21$, we have $B^2 = A^2 + C^2$ and $\vec{B} = \vec{A} + \vec{C}$.
Hence option (c) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/14987?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
