![p45](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/742a0b46-6763-4743-8496-54f8d25a96f1.webp)', 'A: at rest
B: in uniform motion
C: in non-uniform acceleration
D: uniformly accelerated', 'The distance-time graph shows a parabolic curve (given as $x = 1.2t^2$).
