B: $4:\sqrt{3}$
C: $2:\sqrt{3}$
D: $\sqrt{3}:2$', 'For constant centripetal force $F = \frac{mv^2}{r}$, we have $v^2 \propto r$ or $v \propto \sqrt{r}$. If $r_1:r_2 = 6:8$, then $v_1:v_2 = \sqrt{6}:\sqrt{8} = \sqrt{6}:2\sqrt{2} = \sqrt{3}:\sqrt{4} = \sqrt{3}:2$. Hmm, check: $\sqrt{6/8} = \sqrt{3/4} = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}$, so ratio is $\sqrt{3}:2\sqrt{2}$... Let me recalculate: $6:8 = 3:4$, so $v \propto \sqrt{3}:\sqrt{4} = \sqrt{3}:2$. But option (a) is $\sqrt{3}:4$—there may be a typo in the source.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:00:20.276Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15278?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = 