B: 8 s
C: 10 s
D: 12 s', 'Acceleration $a = v/t = 1/15$ m/s².
At time $t$: $v = \frac{t}{15}$ m/s.
Kinetic energy $KE = \frac{1}{2}m v^2 = \frac{1}{2} \times 1 \times \left(\frac{t}{15}\right)^2 = \frac{t^2}{450}$.
