Wait — answer key gives (a) 0.4 J. Re-check: $W = 8 \times 10 \times 0.05 = 4$ J = option (c). Answer key says (a).', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15402?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (15425, 'C: 8 m s$^{-1}$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '5. Work, Energy and Power', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives 6 m/s (B) after 10 percent loss, but the saved key is 8 m/s (C).', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1954, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'The bob of a pendulum is released from a horizontal position. If the length of pendulum is 2 m, what is the speed with which the bob arrives at the lower most point. Assume that 10% of its energy is dissipated against air resistance. (Take $g = 10$ m s$^{-2}$)', 'A: 4 m s$^{-1}$
B: 6 m s$^{-1}$
C: 8 m s$^{-1}$
D: 10 m s$^{-1}$', 'Available KE = 90% of $mgl = 0.9 \times 1 \times 10 \times 2 = 18$ J per unit mass. $v = \sqrt{2 \times 18} = \sqrt{36} = 6$... wait: $\frac{1}{2}mv^2 = 0.9 mgl \Rightarrow v = \sqrt{2 \times 0.9 \times 10 \times 2} = \sqrt{36} = 6$ m/s. Answer key says (c) 8 m/s.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15425?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (15430, 'D: 16 J', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '5. Work, Energy and Power', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'The final extra-work calculation gives 12 J (C), but the key is 16 J (D), the total work. The explanation also contains contradictory spring-constant arithmetic.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1955, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'If 4 J of work is required to stretch a spring through 10 cm beyond its unstretched length. The extra work required to stretch it through additional 10 cm shall be', 'A: 4 J
B: 8 J
C: 12 J
D: 16 J', 'Work done in stretching a spring is $W = \frac{1}{2}kx^2$.
For $x = 0.1$ m: $W_1 = \frac{1}{2}k(0.1)^2 = 4$ J, giving $k = 8000$ N/m.
For additional stretch from 0.1 m to 0.2 m: $W_2 = \frac{1}{2}k(0.2)^2 - \frac{1}{2}k(0.1)^2 = 16 - 4 = 12$ J.
But the extra work needed is $\frac{1}{2}k(0.2)^2 - \frac{1}{2}k(0.1)^2 = 12$ J beyond 4 J, totalling 16 J from start.
Actually, additional work from 10 cm to 20 cm = $16 - 4 = 12$ J is incorrect; recalculate: $W = \frac{1}{2}k(0.2)^2 - 4 = 16 - 4 = 12$ J extra. Wait: $\frac{1}{2}(8000)(0.04) - 4 = 160 - 4 = 156$. Let me reconsider: if 4 J for 10 cm, then for 20 cm it''s $4 \times 4 = 16$ J total, so extra = $16 - 4 = 12$ J. The answer is 12 J.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15430?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (15442, 'B: 1000 litre', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '5. Work, Energy and Power', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives 1200 litres, which is offered as D, then falsely says no option matches and accepts the 1000-litre key B.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1956, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'The power of a water pump is 2 kW. If g = 10 m s⁻², the amount of water it can raise in one minute to a height of 10 m is', 'A: 2000 litre
B: 1000 litre
C: 100 litre
D: 1200 litre', 'Power = 2 kW = 2000 W. Work in 60 s: $W = Pt = 2000 \times 60 = 120000$ J.
For mass m: $mgh = 120000$, so $m \times 10 \times 10 = 120000$, thus $m = 1200$ kg.
Volume of water = $1200 / 1 = 1200$ litre. Wait, density of water is 1 kg/litre, so 1200 kg = 1200 litre. But option (b) is 1000 litre. Let me recalculate: $2000 \times 60 / (10 \times 10) = 120000 / 100 = 1200$ kg = 1200 litre. This doesn''t match any option exactly. Checking option (b): 1000 litre = 1000 kg, so power = $1000 \times 10 \times 10 / 60 = 100000 / 60 ≈ 1667$ W, not 2000 W. So there may be an error in the source or my calculation. Given standard answer keys, option (b) is listed as correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15442?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_