B: $\frac{12}{11}$
C: $\frac{48}{33}$
D: $\frac{11}{9}$', 'Power = Work / Time = $mgh / t$.
Ratio of powers = $(m_1 / m_2) \times (t_2 / t_1) = (4/3) \times (11/12) = 44/36 = 11/9$. Wait, let me recalculate: $(4/3) \times (11/12) = 44/36 = 11/9$, which is option (d). But the key lists (c) as 48/33. Let me check: $48/33 = 16/11$. Hmm, $(4/3) \times (12/11) = 48/33$, but that would be if time ratio is inverted. If man 1 takes 12 and man 2 takes 11, then man 1''s power is lower. So power ratio = $(4/3) / (12/11) = (4/3) \times (11/12) = 11/9$, which is option (d). The answer key shows (c), so there''s a discrepancy.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15446?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXC