Validate the current key and retained explanation; preserve correct answers, normal approximations and resolved self-corrections.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2295, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Which one of the following statements is not true about Newton''s second law of motion $F = ma$?', 'A: The second law of motion is consistent with the first law.
