derived_option', 'The momentum calculation gives 9 m/s (A) and the explanation explicitly says correctAnswer should be 0, but saved C is 6.5 m/s. Check the direction of the rebounding car.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1896, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'A car of mass 1000 kg travelling at 32 m s$^{-1}$ dashes into the rear of a truck of mass 8000 kg, moving in the same direction with a velocity of 4 m s$^{-1}$. After the collision, the car bounces with a velocity of 8 m s$^{-1}$. What is the velocity of the truck after the impact?', 'A: 9 m/s
