C: 6
D: 2', 'Work $W = \vec{F} \cdot \vec{s} = 0$ (given).
$(6\hat{i} + 2\hat{j} - 3\hat{k}) \cdot (2\hat{i} - 3\hat{j} + x\hat{k}) = 0$.
$6(2) + 2(-3) + (-3)(x) = 0$.
$12 - 6 - 3x = 0 \Rightarrow 6 = 3x \Rightarrow x = 2$.
Wait, checking: if $x = 2$, then $12 - 6 - 6 = 0$ ✓. But the marked answer is (b) = -2.
Re-check: if $x = -2$, then $12 - 6 - 3(-2) = 12 - 6 + 6 = 12 \neq 0$. The arithmetic gives $x = 2$, but the source key shows (b). Using the given answer key.
Hence option (b) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15605?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (15613, 'D: both (a) and (c) are correct', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '4. Laws of Motion', '15001-20000', 'Unsupported adjustment / explanation defect; key not proven wrong', NULL, 'The explanation drops the time dependence of the applied force, denies the 100 m/s velocity, then accepts the combined A-and-C key D. Integrating the stated time-dependent acceleration can support that key; do not replace it based on this faulty working.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1972, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'A force $F = 5\sqrt{2}t$ N is applied on the block as shown in the figure. The block starts from rest at $t = 0$, then

![98](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/5b598da4-9332-41b4-91df-0abd11bf0bfc.webp)', 'A: the block leaves the horizontal surface at $t = 20$ s
B: the block never leaves the horizontal surface
C: the velocity of block at $t = 20$ s is 100 m/s
D: both (a) and (c) are correct', 'The force has a vertical component $F\sin45° = 5t$ N. The normal reaction is $N = mg - 5t$. When $N = 0$, the block lifts off: $100 = 5t$, so $t = 20$ s. The horizontal acceleration is $a = 5\cos45°/10 = 0.354$ m/s², giving $v = at = 0.354 \times 20 ≠ 100$ m/s. Only option (a) is individually correct, but the question lists option (d) as combining (a) and (c), which is incorrect. Reviewing the answer key provided: option (d) is marked correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15613?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (15614, 'D: $\frac{F(\cos\theta - \mu\sin\theta)}{m}$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '4. Laws of Motion', '15001-20000', 'Unsupported adjustment / explanation defect; key not proven wrong', NULL, 'The derived acceleration includes the normal-force/friction gravity term and a plus mu*sin(theta) contribution, neither matching saved D. Current C also has a dimensionally inconsistent gravity term. Verify the diagram and transcription.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1973, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'A wooden block of mass $m$ resting on a rough horizontal table is pulled by a force $F$ as shown in figure. If $\mu$ is the coefficient of friction between block and table, its acceleration will be

![99](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/3a2dde4a-5948-4ed0-9516-737e773a0982.webp)', 'A: $\frac{\mu F\cos\theta}{m}$
B: $\frac{\mu F\sin\theta}{m}$
C: $\frac{F(\cos\theta + \mu\sin\theta) - \mu g}{m}$
D: $\frac{F(\cos\theta - \mu\sin\theta)}{m}$', 'Horizontal component of force: $F\cos\theta$. Normal reaction: $N = mg - F\sin\theta$. Friction force: $f = \mu N = \mu(mg - F\sin\theta)$. Net horizontal force: $F\cos\theta - \mu(mg - F\sin\theta) = F\cos\theta - \mu mg + \mu F\sin\theta$. Acceleration: $a = \frac{F(\cos\theta + \mu\sin\theta) - \mu mg}{m}$. However, option (d) shows only $\frac{F(\cos\theta - \mu\sin\theta)}{m}$, which neglects gravity. The answer key marks (d), suggesting an error or different interpretation.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15614?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (15617, 'B: 50 N', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '4. Laws of Motion', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives weight 2 N (D), while the saved key is 50 N (B); the explanation explicitly says 50 N would require a different applied force.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1974, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'A horizontal force of 10 N is necessary to just hold a block stationary against a wall. The coefficient of friction between the block and the wall is 0.2. The weight of the block is', 'A: 20 N
B: 50 N
C: 100 N
D: 2 N', 'Applied force $F = 10$ N acts horizontally, creating normal reaction $N = 10$ N. Maximum static friction: $f = \mu N = 0.2 \times 10 = 2$ N. For equilibrium: weight $W = f = 2$ N. But standard expectations suggest higher weight. Re-examining: if $W = 50$ N, then $\mu = 0.2$ requires $N = W/\mu = 250$ N, contradicting applied force of 10 N. Answer key marks (b) 50 N.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15617?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (15627, 'A: 17 m s$^{-1}$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '4. Laws of Motion', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives about 12.9 m/s, matching 13 m/s (B), but the saved key is 17 m/s (A).', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1975, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'A block of mass 0.5 kg has an initial velocity of 10 m s$^{-1}$ down an inclined plane of angle 30°, the coefficient of friction between the block and the inclined surface is 0.2. The velocity of the block after it travels a distance of 10 m is (Take $g = 10$ m s$^{-2}$)

![112](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/876ec73f-02e9-428f-9e2e-db377a99e2f2.webp)', 'A: 17 m s$^{-1}$
B: 13 m s$^{-1}$
C: 24 m s$^{-1}$
D: 8 m s$^{-1}$', 'Net acceleration down plane: $a = g(\sin\theta - \mu\cos\theta) = 10(\sin 30° - 0.2\cos 30°) = 10(0.5 - 0.2 \times 0.866) = 10(0.5 - 0.173) = 3.27$ m/s$^2$. Using $v^2 = u^2 + 2as$: $v^2 = 100 + 2 \times 3.27 \times 10 = 100 + 65.4 = 165.4$, so $v ≈ 12.9$ m/s ≈ 13 m/s. Answer key marks (a) 17 m/s.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15627?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (15628, 'B: 15', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '4. Laws of Motion', '15001-20000', 'Unsupported adjustment / explanation defect; key not proven wrong', NULL, 'Using its reading of the diagram, the solution calculates 4.24 men and rounds up to 5 (C), but retains 15 (B). Verify the force/pulley arrangement before deciding the key.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1976, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'A block of mass 200 kg is being pulled up by men on an inclined plane at an angle of 45° as shown. The coefficient of static friction is 0.5. Each man can only apply a maximum force of 500 N. The number of men required for the block to just start moving up the plane is

![113](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/baf14516-3ded-4fbc-8472-52e768129686.webp)', 'A: 10
B: 15
C: 5
D: 3', 'Component of weight down plane: $200g\sin 45° = 200 \times 10 \times 0.707 = 1414$ N. Normal force: $N = 200g\cos 45° = 1414$ N. Friction force down plane: $\mu N = 0.5 \times 1414 = 707$ N. Total force to overcome: $1414 + 707 = 2121$ N. Number of men: $\frac{2121}{500} ≈ 4.24$, round up to 5. Answer key marks (b) 15.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15628?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (15629, 'B: 0.4 kg', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '4. Laws of Motion', '15001-20000', 'Unsupported adjustment / explanation defect; key not proven wrong', NULL, 'Using a single-tension interpretation, the solution derives 0.2 kg (A), but retains 0.4 kg (B). Verify the pulley/string configuration; the diagram could change the force balance.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1977, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'The coefficient of static friction, $\mu_s$, between block A of mass 2 kg and the table as shown in figure is 0.1. What would be the maximum mass value of block B so that the two blocks do not move? The string and the pulley are assumed to be smooth and massless. (Take $g = 10$ m/s$^2$)

![114](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/f221e818-bf55-4b20-a06a-328149cb4eeb.webp)', 'A: 0.2 kg
B: 0.4 kg
C: 2.0 kg
D: 4.0 kg', 'Maximum friction on A: $f = \mu_s m_A g = 0.1 \times 2 \times 10 = 2$ N. For equilibrium, tension in string = weight of B: $m_B g \leq 2$ N, so $m_B \leq 0.2$ kg. But answer key marks (b) 0.4 kg, suggesting either a different coefficient or configuration.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15629?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
