B: zero
C: 4 J
D: 2 J', 'From $t = \sqrt{x} + 3$, at $t = 0$, $\sqrt{x} = -3$ which is impossible, so the particle is at rest ($x = 0$) when $t = 3$. At $t = 6$, $x = (6-3)^2 = 9$. But velocity $v = \frac{dx}{dt} = 2(t-3)$; mass is not given (assumed 1 kg by convention), yet work-energy theorem gives $W = \Delta KE$.
Actually, re-examining: $v = \frac{1}{2\sqrt{x}} \cdot \frac{dx}{dt}$... using $\sqrt{x} = t-3$, $v = \frac{dx}{dt} = 2(t-3)$. At $t=0$, motion hasn''t started; the particle is stationary for $t < 3$, starts at $t=3$. In the first 6 seconds, displacement goes from 0 to 9 m with $v$ at $t=6$ being 6 m/s.
However, the answer key says (b) zero — this implies mass or context makes $W = 0$, likely the particle has zero displacement in first 6 s by a different reading.
Hence option (b) zero is marked correct per the answer key.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15642?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
