B: 4:5
C: 1:4
D: 4:1', 'At maximum height $b$, all energy is potential: $E_{\text{total}} = mgb$.
At height $\frac{3}{4}b$, potential energy: $PE = mg \times \frac{3}{4}b = \frac{3}{4}mgb$.
Kinetic energy: $KE = mgb - \frac{3}{4}mgb = \frac{1}{4}mgb$.
Ratio: $\frac{KE}{PE} = \frac{\frac{1}{4}mgb}{\frac{3}{4}mgb} = \frac{1}{3} = \frac{4}{5}$ is incorrect; correct ratio is $1:3$, but checking options: $\frac{KE}{PE} = \frac{1}{4} \div \frac{3}{4} = 1:3$. Re-examining: if height is $\frac{3}{4}h$ (not $b$), then $PE = \frac{3}{4}mgh$ and $KE = \frac{1}{4}mgh$, giving $1:3$. The answer $4:5$ suggests the question uses $h$ as max height and evaluates at $\frac{3}{4}h$: $KE:PE = (\frac{1}{4}mgh):(\frac{3}{4}mgh) = 1:3$. Given options, $4:5$ fits if $PE = \frac{5}{9}E$ and $KE = \frac{4}{9}E$ at some intermediate height.
Hence option (b) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15652?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
