B: 20 cm
C: 40 cm
D: 10 cm', 'Use the formula for centre of mass: $x_{cm} = \frac{m_1 x_1 + m_2 x_2 + m_3 x_3}{m_1 + m_2 + m_3}$.
Substitute: $x_{cm} = \frac{300(0) + 500(40) + 400(70)}{300 + 500 + 400} = \frac{0 + 20000 + 28000}{1200} = \frac{48000}{1200} = 40$ cm.
