B: $66$ g
C: $76$ g
D: $86$ g', 'New pivot: 45.0 cm; Coins: at 12.0 cm, total mass $= 10$ g = 0.01 kg.
Torque due to coins about new pivot: $0.01 \times (45 - 12) = 0.01 \times 33 = 0.33$ Nm.
Stick COM shifts from 50.0 cm to 45.0 cm, a shift of 5 cm.
Let stick mass be $M$ kg. For equilibrium: $M \times g \times 0.05 = 0.33$ (approximately).
$M = 0.33 / 0.5 = 0.66$ kg = 660 g... which is too large. Recalculating in grams: Torque from coins = $10 \times 33 = 330$ g·cm.
Stick COM initially at 50 cm; new pivot at 45 cm means stick exerts torque $M \times (50-45) = 5M$ g·cm on the opposite side.
Balance: $5M = 330$, so $M = 66$ g... but the stick is 1 meter (100 g total including the pivot shift).
Using moments: $10 \times 33 = M \times 5$; $M = 66$ g. But this doesn''t account for both sides of the pivot.
Full calculation: Coins at 12 cm, pivot at 45 cm. Stick COM at 50 cm (original). New equilibrium at 45 cm.
Torque balance: $10(45-12) = M(50-45)$; $10 \times 33 = M \times 5$; $M = 66$ g... Hmm. Let me reconsider: stick extends from 0 to 100 cm. Coins at 12 cm, pivot at 45 cm.
$10 \times (45-12) = M \times (50-45)$; this gives $M = 66$ g, but this seems too low for the entire stick.
Alternatively, the stick may be non-uniform or the problem intends a different interpretation. Given the answer is (c) $76$ g, the calculation likely involves a more complex setup.
Hence option (c) is stated as correct (from answer key).', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/15851?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
