B: 10
C: 15
D: 20', 'Initial moment of inertia: $I_i = I_{\text{rod}} + 2m r_{\text{initial}}^2 = \frac{1}{12} \cdot 0.75 \cdot 0.4^2 + 2 \cdot 1 \cdot 0.1^2 \approx 0.01 + 0.02 = 0.03$ kg m$^2$.
