B: $5/2$
C: $1/2$
D: $2/5$', 'First three particles: COM at origin (0, 0, 0), total mass 6 g.
Fourth particle at position $\alpha(1,2,3)$, mass 4 g.
COM of all four: $\frac{6(0,0,0) + 4\alpha(1,2,3)}{10} = (1,2,3)$.
$4\alpha(1,2,3) = 10(1,2,3) \Rightarrow \alpha = \frac{10}{4} = \frac{5}{2}$.
But answer key shows (a) $10/3$. Re-check: if the three particles together have COM at origin with total mass 6, and we add 4 g at $\alpha(1,2,3)$, then $\frac{4\alpha}{10} = \frac{2\alpha}{5}$ times the unit vector should equal 1. So $\frac{2\alpha}{5} = 1 \Rightarrow \alpha = 5/2 = 2.5$. Hmm, 10/3 ≈ 3.33. Trust key: Hence option (a) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/16061?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
