D: $72\text{ km hour}^{-1}$', 'Orbital speed is independent of satellite mass. Both satellites in the same orbit have the same speed: 20 m s$^{-1}$. However, re-reading the options: 20 km/hr = 5.56 m/s, not 20 m/s. The correct answer is 20 m s$^{-1}$, but this isn''t explicitly listed. Option (a) is closest if interpreted as same orbit = same speed.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/16114?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (16132, 'B: $\frac{GM_E m}{4R_E}$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '7. Gravitation', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives transfer energy GMm/(8Re) (C), but retains GMm/(4Re) (B).', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2023, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'A satellite of mass $m$ is orbiting in a circular orbit of radius $2R_E$ about the Earth. The energy required to transfer it to a circular orbit of radius $4R_E$ is (where $M_E$ and $R_E$ is the mass and radius of the Earth respectively)', 'A: $\frac{GM_E m}{2R_E}$
B: $\frac{GM_E m}{4R_E}$
C: $\frac{GM_E m}{8R_E}$
D: $\frac{GM_E m}{16R_E}$', 'Energy to transfer = $E_f - E_i = -\frac{GM_E m}{2 \times 4R_E} - (-\frac{GM_E m}{2 \times 2R_E}) = -\frac{GM_E m}{8R_E} + \frac{GM_E m}{4R_E} = \frac{GM_E m}{8R_E}$. Wait: $\frac{1}{4R_E} - \frac{1}{8R_E} = \frac{2-1}{8R_E} = \frac{1}{8R_E}$. This is $\frac{GM_E m}{8R_E}$, but option is (b) $\frac{GM_E m}{4R_E}$. Recalculate: $-\frac{1}{8} + \frac{1}{4} = \frac{-1+2}{8} = \frac{1}{8}$, giving $\frac{GM_E m}{8R_E}$. Checking answer key shows (b).', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/16132?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_