Prior contextual-review reason: Derived inverse-square relation agrees with actual saved C; confusing historical option commentary does not establish a current conflict.
Validate the current key and retained explanation; preserve correct answers, normal approximations and resolved self-corrections.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2316, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'If one assumes that the gravitational force due to the earth decreases in proportion to the inverse square of the distance from the centre of the earth, then which of the following relation between $a_m$ (centripetal acceleration of moon), $r$ (distance of the moon from center of the earth), $g$ (acceleration due to gravity on the surface of the earth) and $R_E$ (radius of the earth) is correct?', 'A: $\frac{g}{a_m} = \frac{R_E}{R_m}$
B: $\frac{g}{a_m} = \left(\frac{R_E}{Rm}\right)^2$
C: $\frac{g}{a_m} = \left(\frac{R_m}{R_E}\right)^2$
D: None of these', 'Surface gravity: $g = \frac{GM}{R_E^2}$.
Moon''s centripetal acceleration: $a_m = \frac{GM}{r^2}$.
$\frac{g}{a_m} = \frac{GM/R_E^2}{GM/r^2} = \left(\frac{r}{R_E}\right)^2 = \left(\frac{R_E}{r}\right)^{-2}$.
Note: options (b) and (c) appear identical in the source; option (b) $\frac{g}{a_m} = \left(\frac{R_E}{r}\right)^2$ is incorrect. The correct form is $\frac{a_m}{g} = \left(\frac{R_E}{r}\right)^2$.
Hence option (c) is correct (assuming it is meant as written).', NULL, 'All-rule screening validation requested; previously excluded; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/16165?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
