B: 0.31 m s$^{-1}$
C: 0.96 m s$^{-1}$
D: 3.4 m s$^{-1}$', 'Flow rate $Q = A_1 v_1 = A_2 v_2$. Convert: 1.2 m/min = 0.02 m/s. $Q = 6 \times 10^{-4} \times 0.02 = 1.2 \times 10^{-5}$ m$^3$/s. Area of 50 holes: $A_2 = 50 \times \pi (0.5 \times 10^{-3})^2 \approx 3.93 \times 10^{-5}$ m$^2$. Speed $v_2 = \frac{Q}{A_2} = \frac{1.2 \times 10^{-5}}{3.93 \times 10^{-5}} \approx 0.31$ m/s. But option (c) is 0.96 m/s, which is listed as correct.
