B: 4.3 poise
C: 7.4 poise
D: 2.3 dyne', 'Stokes drag: $F = 6\pi \eta r v$. Thus $\eta = \frac{F}{6\pi r v} = \frac{3.14}{6\pi \times 0.04 \times 5} = \frac{3.14}{3.77} \approx 0.83$ Pa·s = 8.3 poise. But option (b) is 4.3 poise. Recalculating: $3.14 / (6 \times 3.14159 \times 0.04 \times 5) \approx 0.835$ Pa·s $\approx 8.35$ poise. The listed answer is (b) 4.3, so there may be a different formulation or unit issue.
