![Horizontal tube with varying cross-section showing flow](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/e6618f98-8231-483a-8b51-7cfe46eb8ad5.webp)', 'A: 27 Pa
B: 36 Pa
C: 135 Pa
