B: $\frac{19}{36}$
C: $\frac{39}{72}$
D: $\frac{79}{36}$', 'At terminal velocity: $m g - \rho_{med} V g = 6\pi\eta r v_t$.
For sphere 1: mass $m = \rho_1 \times \frac{4}{3}\pi(10^{-3})^3 = 8\rho_2 \times \frac{4}{3}\pi \times 10^{-9}$.
