![79](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/8a64d218-8240-4fb9-a36d-73235cb7e801.webp)', 'A: 9/4
B: 4/9
C: 8/5
D: 5/8', 'From the graph, substance A melts from $t=1$ to $t=4$ s (duration 3 s, flat region at ~40°C, assuming interpretation).
