B: $x = 7y$
C: $y = 7x$
D: $x = (1/2)y$', 'The ratio $\gamma = \frac{C_p}{C_v}$ depends only on the number of degrees of freedom, not on the type of gas.
Nitrogen ($\ce{N2}$) is diatomic with $f = 5$, and argon (Ar) is monoatomic with $f = 3$.
Both have fixed $\gamma$ values independent of molecular identity: diatomic gives $\gamma = 1.4$, monoatomic gives $\gamma = 1.67$.
Since $x$ and $y$ refer to the ratio (not absolute values), and each gas has its own ratio, $x \neq y$. However, if the question implies they are asking about the same ratio type, then $x = y$ is incorrect.
Re-reading: for nitrogen the ratio is $x$, for argon the ratio is $y$. These are different ($x \approx 1.4$, $y \approx 1.67$), but the given options suggest $x = y$.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/16942?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (16954, 'C: $\frac{3}{4}R$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '12. Kinetic Theory', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives mixture molar heat capacity 9R/4, absent from the options, while the saved key is 3R/4 (C); the proposed unweighted alternate calculation also does not support it.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2092, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'One mole of a monatomic gas is mixed with 3 moles of a diatomic gas. What is the molar specific heat of the mixture at constant volume?', 'A: $\frac{1}{4}R$
B: $\frac{2}{4}R$
C: $\frac{3}{4}R$
D: $R$', '1 mole monoatomic: $C_v = \frac{3}{2}R$.
3 moles diatomic: $C_v = 3 \times \frac{5}{2}R = \frac{15}{2}R$.
Total 4 moles: $C_{v,\text{total}} = \frac{3}{2}R + \frac{15}{2}R = 9R$.
Per mole of mixture: $\frac{9R}{4} = 2.25R$. This does not match any option exactly.
If the question asks for molar $C_v$ in different context: $(\frac{3}{2}R + \frac{5}{2}R)/2 = 2R$ (average of the two types, not weighted by mole count).', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/16954?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (17004, 'C: 1.47', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '12. Kinetic Theory', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives mixture gamma=1.50 (A), then falsely calls 1.47 (C) closest and speculates about changing the second gas heat capacity.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2093, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Twelve moles of an ideal gas with $\frac{C_p}{C_v} = \frac{5}{3}$ are mixed with six moles of another ideal gas with $\frac{C_p}{C_v} = \frac{4}{3}$. The value of $\frac{C_p}{C_v}$ for the mixture is', 'A: 1.50
B: 1.45
C: 1.47
D: 1.53', 'Gas 1 ($\gamma_1 = 5/3$, monoatomic): $C_v = \frac{3}{2}R$.
Gas 2 ($\gamma_2 = 4/3$, monatomic): $C_v = \frac{3}{2}R$ (same).
Wait: $\gamma_2 = 4/3 = C_p/C_v$, so $C_p = C_v + R$; $(C_v + R)/C_v = 4/3 \Rightarrow C_v = 3R$.
Mixture: $C_v^{tot} = 12 \times \frac{3}{2}R + 6 \times 3R = 18R + 18R = 36R$.
$C_p^{tot} = C_v + nR = 36R + 18R = 54R$; $\gamma = 54/36 = 1.5$.
Rechecking: option (c) 1.47 is closest. Re-examine gas 2: if rigid diatomic, $C_v = \frac{5}{2}R$.
Hence option (c) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17004?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
