Validate the current key and retained explanation; preserve correct answers, normal approximations and resolved self-corrections.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2342, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'The $P$-$V$ diagram of a gas undergoing a cyclic process ($ABCDA$) is shown in the graph, where $P$ is in units of N m$^{-2}$ and $V$ in cm$^3$. Identify the incorrect statement.

![106](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/7335c59f-1e0b-4bea-9eae-d64b4fb0d18e.webp)', 'A: 0.4 J of work is done by the gas from $A$ to $B$.
B: 0.2 J of work is done on the gas from $C$ to $D$.
C: No work is done by the gas from $B$ to $C$.
D: Work is done by the gas from $B$ to $C$ and on the gas from $D$ to $A$.', '$B\to C$ and $D\to A$ are vertical lines (constant volume) in the diagram, so no work is done in either.
