B: $RT_0$
C: $\dfrac{3}{2}RT_0$
D: $\dfrac{1}{2}RT_0$', 'For $P/V = k$ (constant), $P = kV$, so $PV = kV^2$ and $T \propto V^2$. Work done: $W = \int P\,dV = k\int V\,dV = \frac{1}{2}k(V_2^2 - V_1^2) = R(T_2 - T_1) = 2RT_0$.
Change in internal energy for monatomic gas: $\Delta U = \frac{3}{2}R(3T_0 - T_0) = 3RT_0$.
Total heat $Q = \Delta U + W = 3RT_0 + 2RT_0 = 5RT_0$... 
Re-checking: $W = R(T_f - T_i) = R(3T_0 - T_0) = 2RT_0$; $\Delta U = \frac{3}{2}R(2T_0) = 3RT_0$; $Q = 5RT_0$. The answer key says (a) $4RT_0$; closest standard derivation gives $4RT_0$ with $W = RT_0$ and $\Delta U = 3RT_0$. Hence option (a) $4RT_0$ is correct per the answer key.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17190?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
