B: $\sqrt{3}$ and $\pi/12$
C: $\frac{2}{\sqrt{3}}$ and $\pi/12$
D: $\sqrt{3}$ and $\pi/6$', 'For $x_1 = a(\sin\omega t + \cos\omega t)$, $A_1 = a\sqrt{1^2 + 1^2} = a\sqrt{2}$. Phase: $\tan\phi_1 = 1$, so $\phi_1 = \pi/4$. For $x_2 = a\sin\omega t + \frac{a}{\sqrt{3}}\cos\omega t$, $A_2 = a\sqrt{1 + 1/3} = a\sqrt{4/3} = \frac{2a}{\sqrt{3}}$. Phase: $\tan\phi_2 = \sqrt{3}$, so $\phi_2 = \pi/3$. Amplitude ratio: $\frac{a\sqrt{2}}{2a/\sqrt{3}} = \frac{\sqrt{2}\sqrt{3}}{2} = \frac{\sqrt{6}}{2}$. This doesn''t match options cleanly; rechecking: $A_1/A_2 = \sqrt{2} / (2/\sqrt{3}) = \sqrt{2}\sqrt{3}/2 \neq$ listed options. However, answer key shows (b), suggesting $A_1 = a\sqrt{2}$ and phase diff $\pi/3 - \pi/4 = \pi/12$.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17286?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_