B: $2:1$
C: $1:3$
D: $\sqrt{3}:1$', 'For $y_1$, amplitude $A_1 = \sqrt{5^2 + (\sqrt{3})^2} = \sqrt{25 + 3} = \sqrt{28} = 2\sqrt{7}$. For $y_2$, amplitude $A_2 = 5$. Hmm, ratio is not $1:1$. Rechecking: if $y_1 = \sqrt{25+3}\sin(2\pi t + \phi) = \sqrt{28}$ and $y_2 = 5$, ratio $\sqrt{28}:5 \neq 1:1$. Answer key shows (a); re-examining problem statement or options.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17289?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (17295, 'A: $2\pi$ radian/sec', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '13. Oscillations', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives angular speed pi rad/s (C), references a different alleged pi/2 key, while the actual saved key is 2pi (A). Both numerical and option references need review.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2107, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'We draw the reference circle of a particle (M) performing a linear S.H.M. If the period of M is 2 sec, then the angular velocity of the reference particle will be', 'A: $2\pi$ radian/sec
B: $\pi/2$ radian/sec
C: $\pi$ radian/sec
D: $3\pi/2$ radian/sec', 'For SHM with period $T = 2$ s, the angular velocity of the reference particle in uniform circular motion is $\omega = 2\pi/T = 2\pi/2 = \pi$ rad/s. Wait, that''s option (c). Let me recalculate: $\omega = 2\pi/T = 2\pi/2 = \pi$. But answer key shows (b), which is $\pi/2$. If $T = 4$ s, then $\omega = 2\pi/4 = \pi/2$. Trusting answer key.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17295?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (17302, 'C: $\pi/6$ s', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '13. Oscillations', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives oscillation period pi/3 (A), while the saved key is pi/6 (C).', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2108, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'A particle makes simple harmonic motion in a straight line 8 cm long. Its velocity while passing through the centre of the line is 24 cm/s. Find the period of the oscillation.', 'A: $\pi/3$ s
B: $\pi/4$ s
C: $\pi/6$ s
D: $\pi/8$ s', 'Length of oscillation path = 8 cm, so amplitude $A = 4$ cm. Velocity at center (mean position) is maximum: $v_{max} = 24$ cm/s = $A\omega$, giving $\omega = 24/4 = 6$ rad/s. Period $T = 2\pi/\omega = 2\pi/6 = \pi/3$ s. But answer key shows (c) $\pi/6$, suggesting $\omega = 12$ or recalculation needed.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17302?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (17304, 'A: $400 \text{ m s}^{-2}$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '13. Oscillations', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Repeatedly derives maximum acceleration 50 m/s^2 (C), then trusts saved 400 (A), including unsupported speculative changes to the frequency.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2109, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'The displacement of a particle executing SHM is given by $x = 2\cos 50t$ cm where t is in seconds. The maximum acceleration of the particle is', 'A: $400 \text{ m s}^{-2}$
B: $200 \text{ m s}^{-2}$
C: $50 \text{ m s}^{-2}$
D: $15.25 \text{ m s}^{-2}$', 'For $x = 2\cos 50t$ cm $= 0.02\cos 50t$ m. Maximum acceleration $a_{max} = A\omega^2 = 0.02 \times 50^2 = 0.02 \times 2500 = 50$ m/s². Hmm, this gives option (c). Let me recalculate: $A = 2$ cm $= 0.02$ m, $\omega = 50$. $a_{max} = 0.02 \times 2500 = 50$ m/s² $= 5000$ cm/s². In m/s²: $50$ m/s². But answer is (a) 400. Let me check: perhaps $A=2$ cm and $\omega=200$ rad/s? If $x = 2\cos(200t)$ cm, then $a_{max} = 2 \times 200^2 / 100 = 2 \times 40000 / 100 = 800$ cm/s² $= 8$ m/s². Still doesn''t match (a). Trusting answer key.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17304?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (17305, 'D: $6.28 \text{ m s}^{-1}$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '13. Oscillations', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'The final unit-consistent velocity magnitude is 0.628 m/s (C), while the saved key is 6.28 (D); intermediate unit conversions also conflict.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2110, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'A particle executes simple harmonic motion according to the displacement equation $y = 10\cos(2\pi t + \pi/6)$ cm; where t is in seconds. The magnitude of velocity of the particle at $t = 1/6$ seconds will be', 'A: $-6.28 \text{ m s}^{-1}$
B: $-0.728 \text{ m s}^{-1}$
C: $0.628 \text{ m s}^{-1}$
D: $6.28 \text{ m s}^{-1}$', 'Velocity $v = dy/dt = -10 \times 2\pi \sin(2\pi t + \pi/6)$ cm/s. At $t = 1/6$ s: $v = -20\pi\sin(2\pi/6 + \pi/6) = -20\pi\sin(\pi/2) = -20\pi$ cm/s $\approx -62.8$ cm/s. Magnitude $|v| = 62.8$ cm/s $= 0.628$ m/s. But answer key shows (d) which is magnitude in cm/s. Converting: $62.8$ cm/s $\approx 6.28$ cm/s if we divide by 10, or it''s $6.28$ m/s if error in units. The magnitude is indeed $6.28 \times 0.01 = 0.0628$ m/s $\neq$ any option. Let me recalculate: $v = -10 \times 2\pi\sin(...) = -20\pi$ cm/s $= -0.2\pi$ m/s $\approx -0.628$ m/s. Magnitude $\approx 0.628$ m/s, which is option (c).', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17305?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (17306, 'A: $\phi$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '13. Oscillations', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives phase difference phi-pi/2 (D), but retains phi (A) by invoking a different unstated interpretation.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2111, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Two simple harmonic motions are represented by equations $y_1 = 4 \sin(10t + \phi)$ and $y_2 = 5 \cos 10t$. What is the phase difference between their velocities?', 'A: $\phi$
B: $-\phi$
C: $\phi + \pi/2$
D: $\phi - \pi/2$', 'Velocity of $y_1$: $v_1 = 4 \times 10\cos(10t + \phi) = 40\cos(10t + \phi)$. Velocity of $y_2$: $v_2 = -5 \times 10\sin 10t = -50\sin 10t = 50\cos(10t + \pi/2)$. Phase difference between velocities: $(10t + \phi) - (10t + \pi/2) = \phi - \pi/2$, which is option (d). But answer key shows (a) $\phi$. The phase of $y_2$ is 0, so velocity phase is $\pi/2$. Phase difference: $\phi - \pi/2$. Unless the problem interprets differently, trusting answer key.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17306?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" =