But option (b) is $2n$ s, which is not $2\pi/n$. If $n = \pi$, then $2\pi/\pi = 2$ and $2\pi = 2\pi$. The answer likely should be $2\pi/n$, which doesn''t cleanly match. Assuming a typo in options or problem, option (c) $2$ s holds if $g = \pi^2$ m/s² and thus $n = \pi$.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17450?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (17452, 'C: 10 s', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '13. Oscillations', '15001-20000', 'Unconfirmed screening hit — contextual review did not establish a discrepancy', 'unsupported_adjustment', 'Flagged at the user''s request for validation of every screening hit, including previously excluded hits. This is NOT a confirmed mismatch or wrong answer.
Screening trigger: unsupported_adjustment: The explanation appears to adjust a result to fit a key, select a nearest option, or invoke an unsupported source-key assumption. Either the solution or key may be wrong; human review is required.
Prior contextual-review reason: 4 sqrt(6) is about 9.8 s and reasonably rounds to the saved 10 s.
Validate the current key and retained explanation; preserve correct answers, normal approximations and resolved self-corrections.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2356, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'The time period of a simple pendulum on the surface of the earth is 4 s. Its time period on the surface of the moon is', 'A: 4 s
B: 8 s
C: 10 s
D: 12 s', 'Moon''s surface gravity $g_m \approx g_e/6$, so $T_m = 2\pi\sqrt{L/g_m} = 2\pi\sqrt{6L/g_e} = \sqrt{6} \times T_e \approx 2.45 \times 4 \approx 9.8 \approx 10$ s.
Closest option is (c), but (d) 12 s is also close. Using exact ratio: if $g_m = g_e/6$, then $T_m = \sqrt{6}T_e \approx 9.8$ s, closer to (c).', NULL, 'All-rule screening validation requested; previously excluded; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17452?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (17484, 'D: $A\sqrt{\frac{2}{3}}$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '13. Oscillations', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives displacement 2sqrt(2)A/3, resembling C with a trailing transcription character, but chooses different sqrt(2/3)A (D) as closest. Review the malformed option against the source.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2120, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'The kinetic energy of a particle executing SHM will be equal to $(1/8)^{\text{th}}$ of its potential energy when its displacement from the mean position is (where $A$ is the amplitude)', 'A: $A\sqrt{2}$
B: $\frac{A}{2}$
C: $\frac{2\sqrt{2}}{3}A d$
D: $A\sqrt{\frac{2}{3}}$', 'Given KE = $\frac{1}{8}$PE.
Total energy $E = $KE + PE = $\frac{1}{8}$PE + PE = $\frac{9}{8}$PE.
PE = $\frac{8}{9}E = \frac{8}{9} \times \frac{1}{2}m\omega^2A^2 = \frac{4}{9}m\omega^2A^2$.
Also PE = $\frac{1}{2}m\omega^2x^2$, so $\frac{1}{2}m\omega^2x^2 = \frac{4}{9}m\omega^2A^2$.
$x^2 = \frac{8}{9}A^2$, thus $x = A\sqrt{\frac{8}{9}} = A\frac{2\sqrt{2}}{3}$. But option (c) shows $d$ instead of full expression.
Closest is option (d): $A\sqrt{\frac{2}{3}}$.
