Validate the current key and retained explanation; preserve correct answers, normal approximations and resolved self-corrections.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2362, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Two travelling waves, $y_1 = A \sin[k(x + ct)]$ and $y_2 = A \sin[k(x - ct)]$ are superposed on a string. The distance between adjacent antinodes is', 'A: $\frac{ct}{\pi}$
B: $\frac{ct}{2\pi}$
C: $\frac{ct}{2k}$
D: $\frac{\pi}{k}$', 'The superposition gives $$y = 2A\sin(kx)\cos(kct)$$, a standing wave.
Antinodes occur where $$\sin(kx) = \pm 1$$, i.e., at $$kx = \frac{\pi}{2}, \frac{3\pi}{2}, \frac{5\pi}{2}, ...$$
Distance between adjacent antinodes: $$\Delta x = \frac{\pi}{k} - (-\frac{\pi}{2k}) = \frac{\pi}{k}$$.
Wait, that''s not right. Let me recalculate: antinodes at $$x = \frac{\pi}{2k}, \frac{3\pi}{2k}, ...$$
Distance $$\Delta x = \frac{3\pi}{2k} - \frac{\pi}{2k} = \frac{\pi}{k}$$.
But option (c) is $$ct/(2k)$$, which has dimensions of length times time. That seems inconsistent.
Re-reading the options: if $$k$$ has dimensions 1/length, then $$ct/(2k)$$ has dimensions of length. And $$\pi/k = \lambda/2$$.
Hence option (d) is correct.', NULL, 'All-rule screening validation requested; previously excluded; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/17593?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
