![Field lines from two positive charges with points A, B, C marked](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/5b0ba1c9-6e5c-4870-b447-209f59c26ec7.webp)', 'A: $E_A > E_B > E_C$
