B: 20200 V
C: 18000 V
D: 13300 V', 'Work done when moving charge: $W = q(V_B - V_A)$.
$10 = 500 \times 10^{-6} \times (20 - V_A)$.
$10 = 5 \times 10^{-4} \times (20 - V_A)$.
