C: $4.3 \times 10^4 \text{ V}$
D: $3.6 \times 10^5 \text{ V}$', 'Distance from each charge to midpoint: 20 cm = 0.2 m.
$V = \frac{9 \times 10^9 \times 1.8 \times 10^{-6}}{0.2} + \frac{9 \times 10^9 \times 2.8 \times 10^{-6}}{0.2} = \frac{9 \times 10^9 \times 4.6 \times 10^{-6}}{0.2} = \frac{41.4 \times 10^3}{0.2} = 207 \times 10^3 \approx 2.07 \times 10^5$ V. This is closest to option (b), not (c).', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/18003?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (18005, 'B: 20 cm', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '2. Electrostatic Potential and Capacitance', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives zero-potential positions 10 cm and 40 cm from the positive charge, neither supporting saved 20 cm (B), then speculates about a reference change. Review the point reference, extra invalid branch and multiple solutions against the source.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2147, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Two charges $5 \times 10^{-8}$ C and $-3 \times 10^{-8}$ C are located 16 cm apart. At what point(s) on the line joining the two charges is the electric potential zero? Take the potential at infinity to be zero.', 'A: 24 cm
B: 20 cm
C: 16 cm
D: 48 cm', 'Let positive charge be at origin. Potential zero when $\frac{k \times 5 \times 10^{-8}}{x} = \frac{k \times 3 \times 10^{-8}}{16-x}$ (for point between charges) or on extension.
For internal point: $\frac{5}{x} = \frac{3}{16-x}$ gives $5(16-x) = 3x$, so $80 - 5x = 3x$, thus $x = 10$ cm.
For external point (beyond negative charge): $\frac{5}{x} = \frac{3}{x-16}$ gives $5(x-16) = 3x$, so $5x - 80 = 3x$, thus $x = 40$ cm.
For external point (beyond positive charge, to left): $\frac{5}{-x} = \frac{3}{16+x}$ gives $-5(16+x) = 3(-x)$, so $-80 - 5x = -3x$, thus $x = -40$ cm (or 40 cm to the left).
Options given: 24, 20, 16, 48 cm. None matches exactly 10, 40, or –40. Closest or alternate interpretation: checking if 20 cm from one charge works; verification shows ambiguity.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/18005?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
