Validate the current key and retained explanation; preserve correct answers, normal approximations and resolved self-corrections.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2384, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'Ohm''s law is not obeyed by', 'A: electrolytes
B: discharge tubes
C: vacuum tubes
D: all of these', 'Electrolytes, discharge tubes, and vacuum tubes all exhibit non-linear $V$-$I$ relationships.
