$0.209 = 1.70 \times 10^{-4}(T - 20)$.
$T - 20 = \frac{0.209}{1.70 \times 10^{-4}} = 1229$ °C.
$T = 1249$ °C $\approx$ 1258 °C (option d) or 1155 °C (option c) depending on rounding.
