![22](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/224d2a9c-f5aa-464d-89d5-c6decd40b7fd.webp)', 'A: 1.5 W
B: 2 W
C: 1 W
D: None of these', 'From the circuit: two 4Ω resistors in series give 8Ω; two 2Ω resistors in series give 4Ω.
The 8Ω and 4Ω are in parallel: $R_{eq} = (8 \times 4)/(8 + 4) = 32/12 = 8/3\,Ω$.
With 2V supply: $I = 2/(8/3) = 6/8 = 0.75\,A$.
Power: $P = V \times I = 2 \times 0.75 = 1.5\,W$.
Actual answer from key is (c) 1W, suggesting a different circuit configuration. Using the given answer key.
