![37](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/d3b89953-d373-4358-8847-d701deebd178.webp)', 'A: $x=\left(\dfrac{I_1}{I_2}\right)a$
B: $x=\left(\dfrac{I_2}{I_1}\right)a$
C: $x=\left(\dfrac{I_1-I_2}{I_1+I_2}\right)a$
