B: Join a resistance of 10 Ω in parallel with S
C: Join a resistance of 20 Ω in parallel with S
D: Join a resistance of 20 Ω in series with S', 'For balance: $\frac{P}{Q} = \frac{R}{S_{eff}}$. With P = Q = R = 10 Ω: $\frac{10}{10} = \frac{10}{S_{eff}}$ gives $S_{eff} = 10$ Ω.
