B: $1.75 \times 10^{-4}$ A
C: $7.0 \times 10^{-4}$ A
D: $14.0 \times 10^{-4}$ A', 'At equilibrium, magnetic torque equals restoring torque: $NIAB = k\theta$.
Here, $N = 200$, $A = 0.02 \times 0.08 = 1.6 \times 10^{-3}$ m², $B = 0.2$ T, $k = 5 \times 10^{-7}$ N·m/degree.
Convert $45°$ to radians: $45° = \frac{\pi}{4}$ rad $\approx 0.785$ rad, but keep in degrees for this problem.
$200 \times I \times 1.6 \times 10^{-3} \times 0.2 = 5 \times 10^{-7} \times 45$.
$200 \times I \times 3.2 \times 10^{-4} = 2.25 \times 10^{-5}$.
$I = \frac{2.25 \times 10^{-5}}{200 \times 3.2 \times 10^{-4}} = \frac{2.25 \times 10^{-5}}{0.064} = 3.5 \times 10^{-4}$ A.
Wait, that''s option (a). Let me recheck: $200 \times 3.2 \times 10^{-4} = 0.064$.
$I = \frac{2.25 \times 10^{-5}}{0.064} = 0.352 \times 10^{-3} = 3.52 \times 10^{-4}$ A ≈ option (a).
However, checking option (c): $7.0 \times 10^{-4}$ A. Let me verify once more.
Actually, double-checking: $200 \times I \times 1.6 \times 10^{-3} \times 0.2 = 5 \times 10^{-7} \times 45$ gives $I \approx 3.5 \times 10^{-4}$ A.
But the marked answer appears to be (c), suggesting a calculation discrepancy. Given standard exam conventions, option (c) is marked.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/18611?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
