D: 220 Ω', 'Peak voltage: $V_0 = 330$ V. RMS: $V_{\text{rms}} = 330/\sqrt{2} \approx 233.3$ V.
Note: $I = 1.5\cos(100\pi t) = 1.5\sin(100\pi t + \pi/2)$ is in peak form (no $1/\sqrt{2}$ factor explicitly stated).
