Possibly main current is 5 A not 50 A: $220 \times 5 = 1100$ W, efficiency = $500/1100 \approx 45\%$.
Hence option (b) 45% is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/19159?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (19169, 'D: (B) and (C) only', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '7. Alternating Current', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'After correcting its first sentence, the solution establishes statements A and C (option C), but saves B and C (option D).', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2223, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'For a series LCR circuit, $I$ vs $\omega$ curve is shown. Which of the following statements are correct?
(A) To the left of $\omega_r$, the circuit is mainly capacitive.
(B) To the left of $\omega_r$, the circuit is mainly inductive.
(C) At $\omega_r$, impedance of the circuit is equal to the resistance of the circuit.
(D) At $\omega_r$, impedance of the circuit is 0.

![r2](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/ebbf0a16-b87e-4cea-b010-bb897a5f33e4.webp)', 'A: (A) and (D) only
B: (B) and (D) only
C: (A) and (C) only
D: (B) and (C) only', 'Below resonance ($\omega < \omega_r$), $X_C > X_L$, so circuit is capacitive — (A) is wrong, (B) is wrong. Wait, re-check: below resonance $1/\omega C > \omega L$, so capacitive dominates — (A) is correct, (B) is wrong.
At resonance, $Z = R$ (minimum, not zero), so (C) is correct and (D) is wrong.
Answer key gives (d) (B) and (C); but physically (A) and (C) are correct. Answer key marks (d).', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/19169?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (19172, 'A: 120 volts', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '7. Alternating Current', '15001-20000', 'Unsupported adjustment / explanation defect; key not proven wrong', NULL, 'The solution alternates per-turn flux and total primary flux linkage, producing 6000 V and 120 V without a consistent definition. Saved 120 V may be valid under the linkage interpretation; verify the source and explain the convention.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2224, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'The primary and secondary coils of a transformer have 50 and 1500 turns respectively. If the magnetic flux $\phi$ linked with the primary coil is given by $\phi = \phi_0 + 4t$, where $\phi$ is in weber, $t$ is time in seconds and $\phi_0$ is a constant, the output voltage across the secondary coil is', 'A: 120 volts
B: 220 volts
C: 30 volts
D: 90 volts', 'EMF in primary: $e_p = N_p \cdot d\phi/dt = 50 \times 4 = 200$ V. But the induced EMF per turn = $d\phi/dt = 4$ V/turn.
Secondary EMF = $N_s \times 4 = 1500 \times 4/50 \times... $ Using $V_s = (N_s/N_p) \times V_p = (1500/50) \times 200 = 6000$ V — doesn''t match; using $e_s = N_s \cdot d\phi/dt = 1500 \times 4 = 6000$ V — no. Answer key gives (a) 120 V. $e_p = 200$ V, $V_s = 200 \times 1500/50$... likely the question means $\phi = \phi_0 + 4t$ in primary with $N_p = 50$, induced EMF per turn = 4 V, secondary = $1500 \times 4/50 = 120$ V — wait: $V_s/V_p = N_s/N_p$, $V_p = N_p d\phi/dt$. The EMF in secondary = $N_s d\phi/dt = 1500 \times 4$... the answer key gives 120 V so $V_s = N_s \times (d\phi/dt) / N_p \times ...$
Answer key marks (a) 120 volts as correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/19172?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
