![r40](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/2f834edb-f9b2-45b4-860f-ec89fa54fa15.webp)', 'A: series with $C$ and has a magnitude $\dfrac{1-\omega^2 LC}{\omega^2 L}$
