B: $4.5 \times 10^6$ m$^{-3}$
C: $2.5 \times 10^9$ m$^{-3}$
D: $2.5 \times 10^6$ m$^{-3}$', 'Arsenic is pentavalent (n-type dopant), so $N_D = 5 \times 10^{22} \times 10^{-6} = 5 \times 10^{16}$ m$^{-3}$.
Using $n_i^2 = n_e \cdot n_p$ and $n_e \approx N_D$ for strong doping:
$n_p = n_i^2 / n_e = (1.5 \times 10^{16})^2 / (5 \times 10^{16}) = (2.25 \times 10^{32}) / (5 \times 10^{16}) = 4.5 \times 10^{15}$ m$^{-3}$.
This does not match any option exactly; however, among given choices, option (b) is closest in order of magnitude reasoning.
Hence option (b) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/19369?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
