![16](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/7a9fed76-8073-4079-bbc5-921422614330.webp)', 'A: $2 \times 10^3$ A
B: $2 \times 10^{-3}$ A
C: $3 \times 10^{-3}$ A
D: $3 \times 10^3$ A', 'For an ideal forward-biased diode, the voltage drop across it is zero (ideal approximation).
The circuit has 3.2 V source across a 100 Ω resistor in series with the diode.
