Validate the current key and retained explanation; preserve correct answers, normal approximations and resolved self-corrections.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2429, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'The angular frequency of EM wave is', 'A: $ck$
B: $\frac{q}{\varepsilon_0}$
C: $\frac{1}{\sqrt{\mu \varepsilon}}$
