B: 10
C: 11
D: 12', 'The number of images produced by two plane mirrors at angle $\theta$ is $n = \frac{360°}{\theta} - 1$ (when the object is asymmetrically placed).
For 5 images: $5 = \frac{360°}{\theta} - 1$, so $\theta = 60°$.
When $\theta$ decreases to $60° - 30° = 30°$: $n = \frac{360°}{30°} - 1 = 12 - 1 = 11$... But checking options, the closest is 10.
Note: exact formula depends on symmetry. Hence option (b) is likely correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/19657?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (19676, 'C: $\sin^{-1}\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '9. Ray Optics and Optical Instruments', '15001-20000', 'Unsupported adjustment / explanation defect; key not proven wrong', NULL, 'Snell substitution repeatedly gives sin(r)=4/9, absent from the exact inverse-sine choices, then accepts sin-inverse(1/2) (C) if calculation differs. Verify source index/angle/options; no automatic replacement key is asserted.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2249, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Refractive indices of water and glass are $\frac{4}{3}$ and $\frac{3}{2}$ respectively. A ray of light travelling in water is incident on the water glass interface at $30°$. The angle of refraction is', 'A: $\sin^{-1}\left(\frac{8}{9}\right)$
B: $\sin^{-1}\left(1\right)$
C: $\sin^{-1}\left(\frac{1}{2}\right)$
D: $\sin^{-1}\left(\frac{5}{8}\right)$', 'Snell''s law at water-glass interface: $n_w \sin 30° = n_g \sin r$.
$\frac{4}{3} \times \frac{1}{2} = \frac{3}{2} \times \sin r$.
$\frac{2}{3} = \frac{3}{2} \sin r$, so $\sin r = \frac{2}{3} \times \frac{2}{3} = \frac{4}{9}$... Rechecking: $\sin r = \frac{4/3 \times 1/2}{3/2} = \frac{2/3}{3/2} = \frac{4}{9}$.
Closest match is $\sin^{-1}(1/2)$ if calculation differs; likely answer is (c).
Hence option (c) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/19676?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (19684, 'A: 1000 Å', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '9. Ray Optics and Optical Instruments', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Repeatedly derives wavelength 4000 angstrom (D), but accepts saved 1000 (A) by speculating about unit confusion.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2250, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Light of certain colour has 2000 waves to the millimetre in air. What will be the wavelength of this light in a medium of refractive index 1.25?', 'A: 1000 Å
B: 2000 Å
C: 3000 Å
D: 4000 Å', 'In air: 2000 waves per mm = $2000 \times 10^3$ waves per metre.
Wavelength in air: $\lambda_0 = \frac{1 \text{ m}}{2000 \times 10^3} = 5 \times 10^{-7}$ m $= 5000$ Å.
In medium with refractive index $\mu = 1.25$: $\lambda = \frac{\lambda_0}{\mu} = \frac{5000}{1.25} = 4000$ Å... but option is 1000.
Rechecking: $1/(2000 \times 10^3) = 0.5 \times 10^{-6}$ m $= 5000$ Å $\to$ in medium $= 4000$ Å.
If answer key says 1000, there may be unit confusion. Option (a) is listed.
Hence option (a) is listed in source.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/19684?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (19686, 'A: $\frac{v_w}{v_a}$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '9. Ray Optics and Optical Instruments', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives refractive index va/vw and lambda-a/lambda-w, explicitly recognises saved A is the reciprocal, then calls A correct solely from the key. Neither derived correct ratio is actually offered.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2251, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'If the velocity and wavelength of light in air is $v_a$ and $\lambda_a$ and that in water is $v_w$ and $\lambda_w$. Then the refractive index of water is', 'A: $\frac{v_w}{v_a}$
B: $\frac{\lambda_w}{v_w}$
C: $\frac{\lambda_w}{\lambda_a}$
D: $\frac{v_a\lambda_a}{v_w\lambda_w}$', 'Refractive index: $\mu = \frac{c}{v}$ where $c$ is speed in vacuum and $v$ is speed in medium.
Assuming air ≈ vacuum: $\mu_w = \frac{v_a}{v_w}$. But this gives reciprocal.
Correct definition: $\mu = \frac{v_{air}}{v_{medium}} = \frac{v_a}{v_w}$. Option (a) shows $v_w/v_a$ which is inverse.
Frequency remains constant: $f = v_a/\lambda_a = v_w/\lambda_w$.
$\mu = \frac{v_a}{v_w} = \frac{\lambda_a}{\lambda_w}$.
Given options, (a) $v_w/v_a$ is the reciprocal; check answer key. Listed as (a).
Hence option (a) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/19686?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
