B: 3.00
C: 1.33
D: 1.40', 'Speed of light in the material: $v = f \lambda = 2 \times 10^{14} \times 5000 \times 10^{-10} = 2 \times 10^{14} \times 5 \times 10^{-7} = 10^8$ m/s.
Refractive index: $\mu = \frac{c}{v} = \frac{3 \times 10^8}{10^8} = 3$... but closest option is 1.50.
Rechecking: $v = 2 \times 10^{14} \times 5 \times 10^{-7} = 1 \times 10^8$ m/s is incorrect calculation.
$v = 2 \times 10^{14} \text{ Hz} \times 5000 \times 10^{-10}$ m $= 10^8$ m/s gives $\mu = 3$. Listed option is (a) = 1.50, suggesting error.
Hence option (a) is listed.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/19687?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
