Validate the current key and retained explanation; preserve correct answers, normal approximations and resolved self-corrections.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2433, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'According to Einstein''s mass–energy equivalence,', 'A: mass and energy are interconvertible
B: energy can be created
C: mass can be created but energy cannot created
D: mass and energy are equivalent', 'Einstein''s mass–energy relation $E = mc^2$ states that mass and energy are two forms of the same entity.
Neither can be created nor destroyed independently; they convert into each other.
The relation shows they are fundamentally equivalent, not that one can be created or destroyed separately.
Hence option (d) is correct.', NULL, 'All-rule screening validation requested; previously excluded; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/19712?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (19724, 'B: $7.5 \times 10^{26}$ J', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '13. Nuclei', '15001-20000', 'Derivation/key contradiction', NULL, 'Derives about 1.64e14 J, explicitly offered as 16.4e13 J (C), then falsely calls saved 7.5e26 J (B) closest.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2252, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'The energy released in the fission of 2 kg of $\ce{U^{235}}$ is (Energy per fission = 200 MeV)', 'A: $5.1 \times 10^{26}$ eV
B: $7.5 \times 10^{26}$ J
C: $16.4 \times 10^{13}$ J
D: $8.2 \times 10^{13}$ MeV', 'Number of nuclei in 2 kg of $\ce{U^{235}}$: $N = \frac{2 \times 10^3}{235} \times 6.022 \times 10^{23} \approx 5.12 \times 10^{24}$.
Total energy = $5.12 \times 10^{24} \times 200$ MeV = $1.024 \times 10^{27}$ MeV.
Converting to joules: $1.024 \times 10^{27} \times 1.6 \times 10^{-13}$ J $\approx 1.64 \times 10^{14}$ J, closest to $7.5 \times 10^{26}$ J when accounting for standard calculation.
Hence option (b) is correct.', NULL, 'Potential candidate — human review required; no correction approved', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:20:07.709Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/19724?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
INSERT INTO public.screening_findings_import ("qid", "answer_key", "solution_key_review_result", "review_status", "subject", "exam", "chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category", "deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status", "flag_status", "flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked", "question", "options", "stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url") VALUES (19726, 'C: $10^{-12}$', 'Not independently determined; inspect the stored solution', 'Human validation required; screening is not an Answer Audit', 'Physics', 'CET', '13. Nuclei', '15001-20000', 'Unsupported adjustment / explanation defect; key not proven wrong', 'unsupported_adjustment', 'The stated radius assumptions yield a volume ratio 10^-15; the solution expands that to a 10^-12–10^-15 range to select 10^-12. Review the intended radius convention/source; this is not proof that the generic approximate key is wrong.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 1933, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'What is the approximate ratio of volume of a nucleus to the volume of an atom?', 'A: $10^{-34}$
B: $10^{-20}$
C: $10^{-12}$
D: $10^{-10}$', 'The nucleus is extremely small compared to the atom. Using $V \propto r^3$ and $r_{nucleus} \approx 10^{-15}$ m, $r_{atom} \approx 10^{-10}$ m, the ratio is $(10^{-15}/10^{-10})^3 = 10^{-15}$, approximately $10^{-12}$ to $10^{-15}$. The closest answer is $10^{-12}$.
