C: $9.98 \times 10^5$ A m⁻¹
D: $10.2 \times 10^5$ A m⁻¹', 'Magnetic field intensity: $H = nI = 1000 \times 2 = 2000$ A/m.
Magnetization: $M = \chi_m H$ where $\chi_m = \mu_r - 1 = 500 - 1 = 499$.
$M = 499 \times 2000 = 9.98 \times 10^5$ A/m.
