Validate the current key and retained explanation; preserve correct answers, normal approximations and resolved self-corrections.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2448, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Which one of the following characteristics is not associated with a paramagnetic material?', 'A: It is weakly magnetised in the direction of the magnetising field, in which it is placed.
B: Its magnetic permeability is greater than one.
C: Its magnetic susceptibility is positive.
D: Its magnetic susceptibility increases with rise in temperature.', 'For paramagnetic materials:
They ARE weakly magnetized parallel to the field (option 1 is correct).
