Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2533, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', '1 g of Mg is burnt in a closed vessel containing 0.5 g of O₂. Which reactant is limiting reagent and how much of the excess reactant will be left?', 'A: O₂ is a limiting reagent and Mg is in excess by 0.25 g.
B: Mg is a limiting reagent and O₂ is in excess by 0.5 g.
C: O₂ is a limiting reagent and Mg is in excess by 0.5 g.
D: O₂ is a limiting reagent and Mg is in excess by 0.75 g.', 'Reaction: $\ce{2Mg + O2 -> 2MgO}$. Mg: 1 g / 24 g/mol = 0.0417 mol. O₂: 0.5 g / 32 g/mol = 0.0156 mol. Stoichiometry requires Mg:O₂ = 2:1. For 0.0156 mol O₂, need 0.0312 mol Mg. Since 0.0417 > 0.0312, Mg is in excess. O₂ is limiting. O₂ consumed: all 0.0156 mol. Mg consumed: 0.0312 mol = 0.0312 × 24 = 0.749 ≈ 0.75 g. Mg excess = 1 − 0.75 = 0.25 g. But option (d) states 0.75 g excess, suggesting different calculation or error in option text. Rechecking: if O₂ limiting produces MgO = 0.0156 × 2 × 40 = 1.248 g. Mg reacted = 0.0156 × 2 × 24 = 0.749 g. Excess Mg = 1 − 0.75 = 0.25 g. Option (a) matches. But marked answer (d) suggests 0.75 g excess (≈ all Mg), implying Mg limiting, which contradicts stoichiometry.', NULL, 'Human validation requested; no scientific or contextual verdict', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:53:25.428Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/20937?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation",