Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2556, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', '29.2% (w/w) HCl stock solution has a density of 1.25 g mL⁻¹. The molecular weight of HCl is 36.5 g mol⁻¹. The volume (in mL) of stock solution required to prepare a 200 mL solution of 0.4 M HCl is', 'A: 8
