Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2558, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'A metal oxide has the formula M₂O₃. It can be reduced by H₂ to give free metal and water. 0.1596 g of M₂O₃ required 6 mg of H₂ for complete reduction. The atomic mass of the metal is', 'A: 27.9
B: 79.8
C: 55.8
D: 159.8', '$\ce{M2O3 + 3H2 -> 2M + 3H2O}$
Molar mass of M₂O₃ = 2M + 48.
Moles of M₂O₃ = 0.1596/(2M + 48).
Moles of H₂ = 0.006/2 = 0.003 mol.
From stoichiometry: 1 M₂O₃ : 3 H₂ → 0.1596/(2M+48) = 0.003/3 = 0.001.
0.1596 = 0.001(2M + 48) → 2M + 48 = 159.6 → M ≈ 55.8.
But option (a) = 27.9, option (c) = 55.8. Recalculate: 2M = 159.6 - 48 = 111.6 → M = 55.8.
Hence option (c) is correct; but answer key shows (a) = 27.9, which is M/2 (possibly a metal like Al).', NULL, 'Human validation requested; no scientific or contextual verdict', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:53:25.428Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/21053?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
