B: 26%
C: 56%
D: 13%', 'Initial moles of $\ce{H2SO4}$ = $0.05 \times 0.5 = 0.025$ mol. Moles of NaOH for residual = $0.060 \times 0.5 = 0.030$ mol. But $\ce{H2SO4}$ requires $2 \times \ce{NaOH}$, so residual $\ce{H2SO4}$ = 0.015 mol. $\ce{H2SO4}$ consumed by ammonia = $0.025 - 0.015 = 0.010$ mol. Moles of $\ce{NH3}$ = 0.010 mol (1:1 ratio with remaining acid). Moles of N = 0.010. Mass of N = $0.010 \times 14 = 0.14$ g. Percentage = $\frac{0.14}{0.50} \times 100 = 28\%$. Closest to 26%. Hence option (b) is correct.', NULL, 'Human validation requested; no scientific or contextual verdict', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:53:25.428Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/22720?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "l