Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2764, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'The empirical formula of a non-electrolyte is CH₂O. A solution containing 6 g of the compound exerts the same osmotic pressure as that of 0.05 M glucose solution at the same temperature. The molecular formula of the compound is', 'A: C₂H₄O₂
