Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2766, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Two elements A and B form compounds having molecular formulae AB₂ and AB₄, when dissolved in 20 g of C₆H₆. 1 g AB₂ lowers the freezing point by 2.3 K whereas 1.0 g of AB₄ lowers it by 1.3 K. The molal depression constant for benzene is 5.1 K kg mol$^{-1}$. The atomic masses of A and B are, respectively', 'A: A=26; B=42.64
B: A=31.72; B=47.02
C: A=13.11; B=24.25
D: A=19.17; B=35.01', 'For AB₂: ΔTf = Kf × m = 2.3 K; m = 2.3/5.1 ≈ 0.451 mol/kg.
Molar mass of AB₂ = 1 g / (0.451 mol/0.02 kg) = 1 / 0.0226 ≈ 44.2 g/mol.
For AB₄: ΔTf = 1.3 K; m = 1.3/5.1 ≈ 0.255 mol/kg.
Molar mass of AB₄ = 1 / (0.255 mol/0.02 kg) = 1 / 0.0127 ≈ 78.7 g/mol.
Let MA = a, MB = b.
AB₂: a + 2b = 44.2 → (i)
AB₄: a + 4b = 78.7 → (ii)
Subtracting (i) from (ii): 2b = 34.5 → b ≈ 17.25 (close to B ≈ 19.17 or variant).
From (i): a = 44.2 - 2(17.25) = 44.2 - 34.5 = 9.7 (doesn''t match exactly).
Recalculating more carefully or checking option values:
Option (d): A=19.17, B=35.01.
AB₂ = 19.17 + 2(35.01) = 89.19 (doesn''t match 44.2).
There''s a discrepancy. Perhaps the problem setup or standard answer differs. Checking option (c):
Option (c): A=13.11, B=24.25.
AB₂ = 13.11 + 2(24.25) = 61.61; AB₄ = 13.11 + 4(24.25) = 110.11 (still doesn''t match).
The correct interpretation may require re-examining the problem or accepting the given answer.
Hence option (d) is the provided answer.', NULL, 'Human validation requested; no scientific or contextual verdict', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:53:25.428Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/23072?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
