Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2767, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'The molal freezing point depression constant for benzene ($\ce{C6H6}$) is 4.90 K kg mol$^{-1}$. Selenium exists as a polymer of the type Se$_x$. When 3.26 g of selenium is dissolved in 226 g of benzene, the observed freezing point is 0.112 K lower than that of pure benzene. The molecular formula of selenium is (Atomic mass of Se = 78.8 g mol$^{-1}$)', 'A: Se₄
B: Se₂
C: Se₆
D: Se₈', 'Freezing point depression: ΔTf = Kf × m = 0.112 K.
Molality: m = 0.112 / 4.90 ≈ 0.0229 mol/kg.
Molar mass of Sₓ = mass / (molality × mass of solvent in kg) = 3.26 / (0.0229 × 0.226) ≈ 3.26 / 0.00517 ≈ 631 g/mol.
Number of Se atoms: x = 631 / 78.8 ≈ 8.
But option (d) is Se₈. Checking if calculation gives x ≈ 6 (option c):
Recalculating: m = 0.112 / 4.90 = 0.02286 mol/kg.
Mass of solvent = 226 g = 0.226 kg.
Moles of solute = 0.02286 × 0.226 ≈ 0.00516 mol.
Molar mass = 3.26 / 0.00516 ≈ 632 g/mol.
x = 632 / 78.8 ≈ 8.
Option (d) seems correct, but (c) is given. Re-examining: perhaps 0.112 K is a typo for 0.168 K or similar.
With ΔTf = 0.112 K, x ≈ 8 (Se₈). But if answer is (c) Se₆, then ΔTf should be different.
Assuming standard answer: option (c) is provided.', NULL, 'Human validation requested; no scientific or contextual verdict', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:53:25.428Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/23075?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
