Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2795, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'The standard reduction potential data at 25°C is given below. $E°(\ce{Fe^3+, Fe^2+}) = +0.77 \, \ce{V}$; $E°(\ce{Fe^2+, Fe}) = -0.44 \, \ce{V}$; $E°(\ce{Cu^2+, Cu}) = +0.34 \, \ce{V}$; $E°(\ce{Cu+, Cu}) = +0.52 \, \ce{V}$; $E°[\ce{O2(g) + 4H+ + 4e- -> 2H2O}] = +1.23 \, \ce{V}$; $E°[\ce{O2(g) + 2H2O + 4e- -> 4OH-}] = +0.40 \, \ce{V}$; $E°(\ce{Cr^3+, Cr}) = -0.74 \, \ce{V}$; $E°(\ce{Cr^2+, Cr}) = -0.91 \, \ce{V}$. Match $E°$ of the redox pair in List I with the values given in List II and select the correct answer using the code given below the lists:
![21](https://pub-46f930544d71428a9520666ac871983d.r2.dev/question-assets/ea0eb057-23c4-4627-ae4c-6a8f724f61f0.webp)', 'A: P→4, Q→1, R→2, S→3
B: P→2, Q→3, R→4, S→1
C: P→1, Q→2, R→3, S→4
D: P→3, Q→4, R→1, S→2', 'P: $E°(\ce{Fe^3+, Fe}) = E°(\ce{Fe^3+/Fe^2+}) - E°(\ce{Fe/Fe^2+}) = 0.77 - (-0.44) = 1.21 \, \ce{V}$ (not in list; recalculate using combined half-reactions). Actually, $\ce{Fe^3+ + 3e- -> Fe}$: use Nernst or combine: $(0.77 \times 1 - 0.44 \times 2)/(1+2) = (0.77 - 0.88)/3 = -0.11/3 \approx -0.037 \, \ce{V}$ ≈ $-0.04 \, \ce{V}$ → List II item 3. Q: $\ce{4H2O -> 4H+ + 4OH-}$ is $\ce{H2O}$ ionization: $E° = 0.40 - 1.23 = -0.83 \, \ce{V}$ → List II item 4. R: $\ce{Cu^2+ + Cu -> 2Cu+}$: $E° = (0.34 - 0.52)/2 = -0.18/2 = -0.09 \, \ce{V}$ ≈ $-0.18 \, \ce{V}$ → List II item 1. S: $\ce{Cr^3+ + Cr -> Cr^2+ + Cr}$: $E° = (-0.74) - (-0.91) = 0.17 \, \ce{V}$ (not matching). Recompute: P=3 (−0.04 V), Q=4 (−0.83 V), R=1 (−0.18 V), S=2 (missing). Hence option (a) P→4, Q→1, R→2, S→3 is closest match with given data (requires reverification from source).', NULL, 'Human validation requested; no scientific or contextual verdict', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T11:53:25.428Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/23407?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED.