Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2889, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'Yes', 'Which of the following rules is not correct regarding IUPAC nomenclature of complex ions?', 'A: Cation is named first and then anion.
B: In coordination sphere, the ligands are named alphabetically.
