Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'published', 'open', 2915, 'Historical finding; no status change in this run', 'No', 'Four compounds, toluene (I), o-Dichlorobenzene (II), m-Dichlorobenzene (III) and p-Dichlorobenzene (IV) are arranged in order of increasing dipole moment. The correct order is', 'A: $\ce{IV < I < III < II}$
B: $\ce{I < II < III < IV}$
