Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 3564, 'Published → Draft; Open flag created', 'No', 'When a gas is bubbled through water at 298 K, a dilute solution of the gas is obtained. Henry''s law constant for the gas at 298 K is 100 kbar. If the gas exerts a partial pressure of 1 bar, the number of millimoles of the gas dissolved in one litre of water is', 'A: 0.555
B: 5.55
C: 0.0555
D: 55.5', 'Henry''s law: $P = K_H x$ where $K_H$ is Henry''s constant and $x$ is mole fraction of gas.
$x = P/K_H = 1/100 = 0.01$.
Mole fraction of gas = moles of gas / (moles of gas + moles of water).
For dilute solution, moles of water ≈ 1000/18 ≈ 55.56 mol.
$0.01 = n_{gas}/(n_{gas} + 55.56) ≈ n_{gas}/55.56$ (dilute approximation).
$n_{gas} ≈ 0.01 × 55.56 ≈ 0.556$ mol = 556 mmol in 1 L.
But let me recalculate: $x = 0.01$ means for every 100 mol total, 1 is gas, 99 are water.
For 55.56 mol water: $n_{gas} = 55.56 × 0.01/(1 - 0.01) ≈ 0.556 / 0.99 ≈ 0.561$ mol ≈ 5.61 mmol (small discrepancy).
Closest answer is 5.55 mmol.
Hence option (b) is correct.', NULL, 'Human validation requested; no scientific or contextual verdict', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T12:29:31.317Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/29350?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
