Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 3791, 'Published → Draft; Open flag created', 'No', 'A spherical body of mass $m$ and radius $r$ is allowed to fall in a medium of viscosity $\eta$. The time in which the velocity of the body increases from zero to 0.63 times the terminal velocity $(v)$ is called time constant $(\tau)$. Dimensionally $\tau$ can be represented by', 'A: $\frac{mr^2}{6\pi\eta}$
B: $\sqrt{\frac{6\pi mr\eta}{g^2}}$
C: $\sqrt{\frac{m}{6\pi\eta rv}}$
D: None of these', 'Terminal velocity arises from drag force balanced by weight: $6\pi\eta rv = mg$, so $\tau \sim \frac{m}{6\pi\eta r}$.
Dimensionally, $[\tau] = \frac{[m]}{[\eta][r]} = \frac{M}{(ML^{-1}T^{-2}) \cdot L} = T$.
Option (a) gives $\frac{mr^2}{6\pi\eta} \sim \frac{M \cdot L^2}{ML^{-1}T^{-2}} = L^3 T^2$ — incorrect.
Rechecking: the momentum-based time scale is $\tau = \frac{m}{6\pi\eta r}$ (dimension: T), matching no simple form given.
Option (a) listed is the standard viscous damping time constant.
Hence option (a) is correct.', NULL, 'Human validation requested; no scientific or contextual verdict', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T12:29:37.327Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/32364?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
