Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 3823, 'Published → Draft; Open flag created', 'No', 'For the same cross-sectional area and for a given load, the ratio of depression for the beam of a square cross-section and circular cross-section is', 'A: $3 : \pi$
