Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 3847, 'Published → Draft; Open flag created', 'No', 'A particle executes simple harmonic motion between $x=-A$ and $x=+A$. The time taken for it to go from 0 to $A/2$ is $T_1$ and to go from $A/2$ to A is $T_2$. Then', 'A: $T_1 < T_2$
B: $T_1 > T_2$
C: $T_1 = T_2$
D: $T_1 = 2T_2$', 'From $x = A\sin(\omega t)$ starting at $t=0$, $x=0$: to reach $A/2$ takes time $t_1$ where $\sin(\omega t_1) = 1/2$, so $\omega t_1 = \pi/6$. To reach $A$ takes $\omega t_A = \pi/2$. Difference for $A/2$ to $A$ is $\Delta t = (\pi/2 - \pi/6)/\omega = (\pi/3)/\omega > \pi/(6\omega)$. Thus $T_2 > T_1$, or $T_1 < T_2$. But answer key shows (b) $T_1 > T_2$. Near amplitude, SHM slows; near equilibrium, it speeds up. So $T_1$ (from 0 to A/2) should be smaller. Option (a) is correct.', NULL, 'Human validation requested; no scientific or contextual verdict', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T12:29:37.327Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/33470?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_s