Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 3949, 'Published → Draft; Open flag created', 'No', 'When 22.4 L of H₂ is mixed with 11.2 L of Cl₂(g) at STP the moles of HCl formed is equal to:', 'A: 1 mole of HCl (g)
B: 2 moles of HCl (g)
C: 0.5 moles of HCl (g)
D: 1.5 moles of HCl (g)', 'Reaction: $\ce{H2 + Cl2 -> 2HCl}$. Moles H₂ = 22.4/22.4 = 1 mol; moles Cl₂ = 11.2/22.4 = 0.5 mol. Cl₂ is limiting (needs 1 mol H₂ per 1 mol Cl₂). 0.5 mol Cl₂ produces 0.5 × 2 = 1 mol HCl. Wait: from stoichiometry, 1 H₂ + 1 Cl₂ → 2 HCl. So 0.5 mol Cl₂ gives 1 mol HCl. But if 1 mol H₂ and 0.5 mol Cl₂, product = 2 × 0.5 = 1 mol HCl. Source says (b) 2 moles, suggesting both fully react: 1 + 0.5 = 1.5 total moles, but that''s not the product amount. Per stoichiometry answer should be 1 mol, not 2. Source may have error, but listed answer is (b).
Hence option (b) is correct per source.', NULL, 'Human validation requested; no scientific or contextual verdict', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T12:29:37.327Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/34957?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
