Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 3967, 'Published → Draft; Open flag created', 'No', '$\ce{Cu+}$(aq) is unstable in solution and undergoes simultaneous oxidation and reduction according to the reaction, $\ce{2Cu+(aq) <=> Cu^{2+}(aq) + Cu(s)}$. Choose correct $E^\circ$ for above reaction if $E^\circ(\ce{Cu^{2+}/Cu}) = 0.34$ V and $E^\circ(\ce{Cu^{2+}/Cu+}) = 0.15$ V:', 'A: $-0.38$ V
B: $+0.49$ V
C: $+0.38$ V
D: $-0.19$ V', 'The disproportionation: cathode half-cell $\ce{Cu+ + e- -> Cu}$, $E^\circ = 0.34 - 0.15 = +0.19$ V (obtained from given data); anode half-cell $\ce{Cu+ -> Cu^{2+} + e-}$, $E^\circ_{\text{oxid}} = -0.15$ V.
$E^\circ_{\text{cell}} = E^\circ_{\text{cathode}} - E^\circ_{\text{anode(red)}} = 0.19 - (-0.15) = +0.34 - 0.15 + 0.15 = 0.34 - (-0.04)$; using $E^\circ = E^\circ(Cu^+/Cu) - E^\circ(Cu^{2+}/Cu^+) = (0.34-0.15) - 0.15 = 0.19 - (-0.19)$.
Correctly: $E^\circ_{cell} = E^\circ(Cu^+/Cu) - E^\circ(Cu^{2+}/Cu^+) = 0.19 - (-0.15) = +0.34 - 0.15 - 0.15$; from answer key result is $+0.38$ V, hence option (c) is correct.', NULL, 'Human validation requested; no scientific or contextual verdict', 'Yes', '2026-10-18T12:29:37.327Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-18T12:34:15.495Z'::timestamptz, 'https://app.ilearn-india.com/admin/questions/35234?from=bank') ON CONFLICT (qid) DO UPDATE SET "answer_key" = EXCLUDED."answer_key", "solution_key_review_result" = EXCLUDED."solution_key_review_result", "review_status" = EXCLUDED."review_status", "subject" = EXCLUDED."subject", "exam" = EXCLUDED."exam", "chapter" = EXCLUDED."chapter", "screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal" = EXCLUDED."screening_batch_existing_question_ordinal", "category" = EXCLUDED."category", "deterministic_rules" = EXCLUDED."deterministic_rules", "question_specific_finding_evidence" = EXCLUDED."question_specific_finding_evidence", "publication_status_at_screening" = EXCLUDED."publication_status_at_screening", "current_publication_status" = EXCLUDED."current_publication_status", "flag_status" = EXCLUDED."flag_status", "flag_id" = EXCLUDED."flag_id", "action_in_this_10k_run" = EXCLUDED."action_in_this_10k_run", "exam_linked" = EXCLUDED."exam_linked", "question" = EXCLUDED."question", "options" = EXCLUDED."options", "stored_explanation" = EXCLUDED."stored_explanation", "numeric_answer_policy" = EXCLUDED."numeric_answer_policy", "original_review_status_context" = EXCLUDED."original_review_status_context", "content_unchanged_since_screening" = EXCLUDED."content_unchanged_since_screening", "screened_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."screened_at_utc", "live_status_checked_at_utc" = EXCLUDED."live_status_checked_at_utc", "question_url" = EXCLUDED."question_url";
