Validate the actual saved key, calculation, current options and any required source/diagram. Neither the key nor an intermediate solution result is automatically authoritative. No paid AI check was performed.', 'published', 'draft', 'open', 3968, 'Published → Draft; Open flag created', 'No', '$K_{sp}$ of $\ce{BaSO4}$ is $1 \times 10^{-10}$. If the ionic conductances of $\ce{Ba^{2+}}$ and $\ce{SO4^{2-}}$ ions are 64 and 80 ohm$^{-1}$ cm$^2$ mol$^{-1}$ respectively, then its specific conductance is:', 'A: $1.44 \times 10^{-8}$ ohm$^{-1}$ cm$^{-1}$
