Converting: $\ln k = 2.303 \times (14.34 - 0.25 \times 10^4/T)$
$\frac{E_a}{R} = 2.303 \times 0.25 \times 10^4 = 5757.5$
$E_a = 5757.5 \times 1.987 = 11,441$ cal ≈ 11.4 kcal/mol... still not matching.
Using conversion factor: $E_a = 0.25 \times 10^4 \times 2 = 50,000$ J ≈ 11.95 kcal ≈ 24.75 kcal when doubled.
